HeroAscensionTalentReferences={[328]={["sourceID"]=2982,["name"]="Seal of Vengeance",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholysealofvengeance",["ranks"]={{["text"]="@learns:954707@\nFills you with holy power, causing main hand auto and Paladin melee abilities to apply Holy Vengeance, which deals ${(0.0066*$SPH+0.0125*$AP)*6} additional Holy damage over 15 sec.\n\nHoly Vengeance can stack up to 5 times. Once stacked to 5 times, each of your main hand auto attacks and Paladin melee abilities deals damage as additional Holy damage. Only one Seal can be active on the caster at any one time. Lasts until canceled.\n\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will deal ${1+0.33*$SPH+0.13*$AP} Holy damage to an enemy, increased by 10% for each application of Holy Vengeance on the target.",["display"]="|cffffff00@learns:954707@\n|rFills |cffffff00you|r with holy power, causing |cffffff00main hand auto and Paladin melee abilities|r to apply Holy Vengeance, which deals |cffffff00${(0.0066*$SPH+0.0125*$AP)*6}|r additional Holy damage over 15 sec.|cffffff00\n\n|rHoly Vengeance can stack up to 5 times.|cffffff00 |rOnce stacked to 5 times, each of |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00main hand auto|r attacks |cffffff00and Paladin melee abilities|r deals damage as additional Holy damage.|cffffff00 |rOnly one Seal can be active on the |cffffff00caster|r at any one time.|cffffff00 |rLasts |cffffff00until|r |cffffff00canceled.|r\n\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will deal |cffffff00${1+0.33*$SPH+0.13*$AP}|r Holy damage to an enemy, increased by 10% for each application of Holy Vengeance on the target.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${(0.0066*$SPH+0.0125*$AP)*6}","${1+0.33*$SPH+0.13*$AP}","@learns:954707@"},["sourceSpell"]=31801,["stockText"]="Fills the Paladin with holy power, causing attacks to apply Holy Vengeance, which deals ${(0.013*$SPH+0.025*$AP)*5} additional Holy damage over 15 sec.  Holy Vengeance can stack up to 5 times.  Once stacked to 5 times, each of the Paladin's attacks also deals 33% weapon damage as additional Holy damage.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.  Lasts 1800 sec.\n\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will deal ${1+0.22*$SPH+0.14*$AP} Holy damage to an enemy, increased by 10% for each application of Holy Vengeance on the target."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="8d27da4a03db089748d38d02e7884f5fcebeb7ace0906a40025e8c86914e25de",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[395]={["sourceID"]=395,["name"]="Burning Soul",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellfirefire",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases spell critical strike chance by 1%.\n\nReduces spell pushback suffered from damaging attacks by 33%.",["display"]="|cffffff00Increases spell critical strike chance by 1%.\n\n|rReduces |cffffff00spell|r pushback suffered from damaging attacks by |cffffff0033%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=11083,["stockText"]="Reduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting Fire spells by 35% and reduces the threat caused by your Fire spells by 10%."},{["text"]="Increases spell critical strike chance by 2%.\n\nReduces spell pushback suffered from damaging attacks by 66%.",["display"]="|cffffff00Increases spell critical strike chance by 2%.\n\n|rReduces |cffffff00spell|r pushback suffered from damaging attacks by |cffffff0066%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=12351,["stockText"]="Reduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting Fire spells by 70% and reduces the threat caused by your Fire spells by 20%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="ce8b3f7598f308af3a9021eaabad0952006043a72c5806b2936e695079539c5e",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[396]={["sourceID"]=396,["name"]="Molten Shields",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellfirefirearmor",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Reduces the cooldown of Fire Ward, Frost Ward, Arcane Ward and Sha