es 4% of its missing mana every 5 sec.\n\nTamed Pet includes Summoned Demon, Enslave Demon, Dominate Undead, Tame Dragonkin or Tether Elemental, and Tame Beast.",["display"]="When you gain mana from Drain Mana or Life Tap spells, your |cffffff00tamed|r |cffffff00pet|r gains 100% of the mana you gain.|cffffff00\n\nYour tamed pet regenerates 4% of its missing mana every 5 sec.\n\nTamed Pet includes Summoned Demon, Enslave Demon, Dominate Undead, Tame Dragonkin or Tether Elemental, and Tame Beast.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=30326,["stockText"]="When you gain mana from Drain Mana or Life Tap spells, your summoned demon gains 100% of the mana you gain."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="d093be83745937ebddd0fbaf6885925997b8cc1d30fab5b421fd00d49a625df1",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[689]={["sourceID"]=689,["name"]="Soul Link",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowgathershadows",["ranks"]={{["text"]="When active, 6% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Summoned or Enslaved Demon. That damage cannot be prevented. Lasts as long as the demon is active, controlled and you are within 30 yards of it.\n\nCannot Soul Link a Summoned Imp.",["display"]="When active, |cffffff006%|r of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your |cffffff00Summoned|r or |cffffff00Enslaved|r |cffffff00Demon.|r That damage cannot be prevented. Lasts as long as the demon is |cffffff00active, controlled|r and |cffffff00you are within 30 yards of it.\n\nCannot Soul Link a Summoned Imp.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=19028,["stockText"]="When active, 20% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Felhunter, Felguard, or enslaved demon instead.  That damage cannot be prevented. Lasts as long as the demon is active and controlled."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="0beed813cfd0d41c0d609187b5f82982986b7696f042e9ff6733575bcf591cbc",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[690]={["sourceID"]=690,["name"]="Molten Core",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarlockmoltencore",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases the duration of your Immolate by 3 sec. Dealing damage with Corruption has a 18% chance to grant you Molten Core and when Corruption is dispelled you have a 50% chance to gain 1 charge of Molten Core.\n\nMolten Core empowers your next 3 spells cast within 15 sec:\n\nIncinerate - Increases damage done by 9% and reduces cast time by 15%.\n\nSoul Fire, Hand of Gul'dan, Shadow Bolt - Increases damage done by 9% and increases critical strike chance by 15%.",["display"]="Increases the duration of your Immolate by 3 |cffffff00sec. Dealing damage with Corruption has a 18% chance to grant you Molten Core|r and|cffffff00 when Corruption is dispelled|r you have a |cffffff0050%|r chance to gain |cffffff001 charge of|r Molten |cffffff00Core.\n\n|rMolten Core empowers your next 3 spells cast within 15 |cffffff00sec:|r\n\nIncinerate - Increases damage done by |cffffff009%|r and reduces cast time by |cffffff0015%.|r\n\nSoul |cffffff00Fire, Hand of Gul'dan, Shadow Bolt|r - Increases damage done by |cffffff009%|r and increases critical strike chance by |cffffff0015%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47245,["stockText"]="Increases the duration of your Immolate by 3 sec, and you have a 4% chance to gain the Molten Core effect when your Corruption deals damage. The Molten Core effect empowers your next 3 Incinerate or Soul Fire spells cast within 15 sec.\n\nIncinerate - Increases damage done by 6% and reduces cast time by 10%.\n\nSoul Fire - Increases damage done by 6% and increases critical strike chance by 5%."},{["text"]="Increases the duration of your Immolate by 6 sec. Dealing damage with Corruption has a 18% chance to grant you Molten Core and when Corruption is dispelled you gain 1 charge of Molten Core.\n\nMolten Core empowers your next 3 spells cast within 15 sec:\n\nIncinerate - Increases damage done by 18% and reduces cast time by 30%.\n\nSoul Fire, Hand of Gul'dan, Shadow Bolt - Increases damage done by 18% and increases critical strike chance by 30%.",["display"]="Increases the duration of your Immolate by 6 |cffffff00sec.|r |cffffff00Dealing|r |cffffff00damage|r |cffffff00with Corruption has|r a |cffffff0018%|r chance to |cffffff00grant|r |cffffff00you|r Molten Core |cffffff00and|r when Corruption |cffffff00is|r |cffffff00dispelled|r |cffffff00you gain 1 charge of|r Molten |cffffff00Core.\n\nMolten |rCore empowers your next 3 spells cast within 15 |cffffff00sec:|r\n\nIncinerate - Increases damage done by |cffffff0018%|r and reduces cast time by |cffffff0030%.|r\n\nSoul |cffffff00Fire, Hand of Gul'dan, Shadow Bolt|r - Increases damage done by |cffffff0018%|r and increases critical strike chance by |cffffff0030%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47246,["stockText"]="Increases the duration of your Immolate by 6 sec, and you have a 8% chance to gain the Molten Core effect when your Corruption deals damage. The Molten Core effect empowers your next 3 Incinerate or Soul Fire spells cast within 15 sec.\n\nIncinerate - Increases damage done by 12% and reduces cast time by 20%.\n\nSoul Fire - Increases damage done by 12% and increases critical strike chance by 10%."},{["missingRank"]=true}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="b0ca57ddc8760b35c5653620a58521f09b861e4ebec7bc9c641ba182cdf8f5f8",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[691]={["sourceID"]=691,["name"]="Improved Curse of Agony",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowcurseofsargeras",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases the damage done by your Curse of Agony by 10%.\nOtherwise: \n\nCapstone Bonus: Curse of Agony can critically hit.",["display"]="Increases the damage done by your Curse of Agony by |cffffff0010%.\nOtherwise: \n\nCapstone Bonus: Curse of Agony can critically hit.|r",