ases the periodic damage done by 30%.\n\nSnake Trap - Increases the number of snakes summoned by 6.\n\nCapstone Bonus: The duration of Freezing Trap is doubled on targets affected by your Scatter Shot.",["display"]="Frost Trap - Increases the duration by 30%.\n\nImmolation Trap, Explosive Trap and Black Arrow - Increases the periodic damage done by 30%.\n\nSnake Trap - Increases the number of snakes summoned by 6.|cffffff00\n\nCapstone Bonus: The duration of Freezing Trap is doubled on targets affected by your Scatter Shot.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=63458,["stockText"]="Frost Trap and Freezing Trap - Increases the duration by 30%.\n\nImmolation Trap, Explosive Trap and Black Arrow - Increases the periodic damage done by 30%.\n\nSnake Trap - Increases the number of snakes summoned by 6."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="c8d3abece9405ceb7d67fc032b000bc10a13e3ba18f1c571ea6702929636f3e6",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[695]={["sourceID"]=695,["name"]="Lock and Load",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityhunterlockandload",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Trapping a target with Freezing Trap, Freezing Arrow or Frost Trap has a 33% chance to cause your next 2 Arcane Shot or Explosive Shot spells to trigger no cooldown, and cost no mana.  \n\nPeriodic damage from Immolation Trap, Explosive Trap and Black Arrow has a 10% to trigger this effect. \n\nThis effect has a 15 sec cooldown.",["display"]="|cffffff00Trapping|r a target with Freezing Trap, Freezing Arrow or Frost Trap |cffffff00has|r a |cffffff0033%|r chance to cause your next 2 Arcane Shot or Explosive Shot spells to trigger no cooldown, |cffffff00and |rcost no |cffffff00mana.  \n\nPeriodic damage from Immolation Trap, Explosive Trap|r and |cffffff00Black|r |cffffff00Arrow|r |cffffff00has|r |cffffff00a 10% to trigger this effect. \n\n|rThis effect has a |cffffff0015|r sec cooldown.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=563