$mw}|r to |cffffff00${0.18*$MW}|r additional Holy damage |cffffff00to|r |cffffff00the target and|r up to 2 additional targets.|cffffff00 |rLasts |cffffff00until|r |cffffff00canceled.|r\n\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing ${0.19*$mw+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH} to ${0.19*$MW+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH} Holy damage.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${0.18*$MW}","${0.18*$mw}","${0.19*$MW+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH}","${0.19*$mw+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH}","@learns:954707@"},["sourceSpell"]=20375,["stockText"]="All melee attacks deal ${0.36*$mw} to ${0.36*$MW} additional Holy damage.  When used with attacks or abilities that strike a single target, this additional Holy damage will strike up to 2 additional targets.  Lasts 1800 sec.\n\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing ${0.19*$mw+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH} to ${0.19*$MW+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH} Holy damage."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="b8b29eca8ad43f551ba39cdffeee0768763e0fbd366afaabbaf747a6bfe21bfd",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[758]={["sourceID"]=758,["name"]="Improved Righteous Fury",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholysealoffury",["ranks"]={{["text"]="While Righteous Fury is active all damage you take is reduced by 1%.\n\nIncreases the total armor bonus you gain from Righteous Fury by an additional 3%.",["display"]="While Righteous Fury is |cffffff00active|r all damage |cffffff00you take|r is reduced by |cffffff001%.\n\nIncreases the total armor bonus you gain from Righteous Fury by an additional 3%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=20468,["stockText"]="While Righteous Fury is active, all damage taken is reduced by 2%."},{["text"]="While Righteous Fury is active all damage you take is reduced by 2%.\n\nIncreases the total armor bonus you gain from Righteous Fury by an additional 6%.",["display"]="While Righteous Fury is |cffffff00active|r all damage |cffffff00you take|r is reduced by |cffffff0