s and the radius of your Prayer of Healing, Holy Nova, Divine Hymn and Circle of Healing spells by 10%."},{["text"]="Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 4 yards. \n\nThis does not stack with other similar effects.\n\nIncreases the radius of your Prayer of Healing, Holy Nova, Divine Hymn, and Circle of Healing spells by 14%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Directly healing or directly damaging a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 20% chance to restore 2% of your missing mana over 4 sec. This effect can only occur once every 15 seconds.",["display"]="Increases the range of your |cffffff00damaging|r spells |cffffff00with a channeling or cast time by 4 yards. \n\nThis does not stack with other similar effects.\n\nIncreases|r the radius of your Prayer of Healing, Holy Nova, Divine |cffffff00Hymn,|r and Circle of Healing spells by |cffffff0014%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Directly healing or directly damaging a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 20% chance to restore 2% of your missing mana over 4 sec. This effect can only occur once every 15 seconds.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=27790,["stockText"]="Increases the range of your Smite and Holy Fire spells and the radius of your Prayer of Healing, Holy Nova, Divine Hymn and Circle of Healing spells by 20%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="ec76ccadb244bc4c41bdb9629378a3a887050d6057bd1b59395c3e407c88732f",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[780]={["sourceID"]=780,["name"]="Blessed Recovery",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyblessedrecovery",["ranks"]={{["text"]="[Reference prerequisite 84867]\nIncrease the effectiveness of your Priest healing spells by 3%.\n\nAfter being struck by a critical strike, you heal for 14% of the damage taken over 6 sec, additional critical strikes taken during the effect increase the healing received.\n\nCapstone Bonus: When Blessed Recovery is active, your De