our Hand of Reckoning ability.",["display"]="Increases your total Stamina by |cffffff002%.\n\nReduces|r the cooldown of your Divine Shield and Divine Protection spells by |cffffff0030|r sec.|cffffff00\n\nIncreases the duration of Divine Shield by 2 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Successfully transferring an attack using Righteous Defense will now also reset the cooldown of your Hand of Reckoning ability.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31849,["stockText"]="Increases your total Stamina by 4%, reduces the cooldown of your Divine Shield and Divine Protection spells by 60 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="ffcf221b77abd108c5ab4d4348fd543650328420f10d0c8c950167830f590c28",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[876]={["sourceID"]=876,["name"]="Ardent Defender",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyardentdefender",["ranks"]={{["text"]="When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 2%.\n\nYou have a 33% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec. \n\nThis effect shares a 2 minute cooldown with Cheat Death and Spirit of Redemption.",["display"]="|cffffff00When|r below 35% health |cffffff00all damage taken |ris reduced by |cffffff002%.\n\nYou|r |cffffff00have|r |cffffff00a 33% chance to fully absorb an attack|r which would otherwise kill |cffffff00you,|r |cffffff00up|r to |cffffff00a|r |cffffff00maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you|r by up to |cffffff0020%|r of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense).|cffffff00 You also take 20% increased|r healing |cffffff00for the next 3 sec. \n\nThis |reffect |cffffff00shares|r |cffffff00a|r |cffffff002|r |cffffff00minute|r |cffffff00cooldown|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00Cheat|r |cffffff00Death|r |cffffff00and Spirit of Redemption.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31850,["stockText"]="Damage that takes you below 35% health is reduced by 7%.  In addition, attacks which would otherwise kill you cause you to be healed by up to 10% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense).  This healing effect cannot occur more often than once every 120 sec."},{["text"]="When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 4%.\n\nYou have a 66% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec. \n\nThis effect shares a 2 minute cooldown with Cheat Death and Spirit of Redemption.",["display"]="|cffffff00When|r below 35% health |cffffff00all damage taken |ris reduced by |cffffff004%.\n\nYou|r |cffffff00have|r |cffffff00a 66% chance to fully absorb an attack|r which would otherwise kill |cffffff00you,|r |cffffff00up|r to |cffffff00a|r |cffffff00maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you|r by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense).|cffffff00 You also take 20% increased|r healing |cffffff00for the next 3 sec. \n\nThis |reffect |cffffff00shares|r |cffffff00a|r |cffffff002|r |cffffff00minute|r |cffffff00cooldown|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00Cheat|r |cffffff00Death|r |cffffff00and Spirit of Redemption.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31851,["stockText"]="Damage that takes you below 35% health is reduced by 13%.  In addition, attacks which would otherwise kill you cause you to be healed by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense).  This healing effect cannot occur more often than once every 120 sec."},{["text"]="When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 6%.\n\nYou have a 100% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec. \n\nThis effect shares a 2 minute cooldown with Cheat Death and Spirit of Redemption.",["display"]="|cffffff00When|r below 35% health |cffffff00all damage taken |ris reduced by |cffffff006%.\n\nYou|r |cffffff00have|r |cffffff00a 100% chance to fully absorb an attack|r which would otherwise kill |cffffff00you,|r |cffffff00up|r to |cffffff00a|r |cffffff00maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you|r by up to |cffffff0020%|r of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense).|cffffff00 You also take 20% increased|r healing |cffffff00for the next 3 sec. \n\nThis |reffect |cffffff00shares|r |cffffff00a|r |cffffff002|r |cffffff00minute|r |cffffff00cooldown|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00Cheat|r |cffffff00Death|r |cffffff00and Spirit of Redemption.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31852,["stockText"]="Damage that takes you below 35% health is reduced by 20%.  In addition, attacks which would otherwise kill you cause you to be healed by up to 30% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense).  This healing effect cannot occur more often than once every 120 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="67bba27ec5fdd8ded9553268bdfde25470a4d45072474768f6b0b852862e0eaf",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[877]={["sourceID"]=877,["name"]="Combat Expertise",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyweaponmastery",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases your Stamina by 2%.\n\nIncreases your chance to hit with spells and abilities by 1%.",["display"]="Increases your |cffffff00Stamina|r by |cffffff002%.\n\nIncreases|r |cffffff00your|r chance to |cffffff00hit|r |cffffff00with spells and abilities|r by |cffffff001%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31858,["stockText"]="Increases your expertise by 2, total Stamina and chance to critically hit by 2%."},{["text"]="Incre