ak from damage from Righteous Vengeance or Seal of Vengeance.",["display"]="Increases all damage |cffffff00done|r by |cffffff003%.\n\nIncreases the critical strike chance of your Holy spells|r and |cffffff00abilities by 3%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Repentance does not break from|r damage |cffffff00from|r |cffffff00Righteous|r |cffffff00Vengeance|r |cffffff00or|r |cffffff00Seal|r |cffffff00of|r |cffffff00Vengeance.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31868,["stockText"]="Increases all damage caused by 3% and all damage caused against Humanoids, Demons, Undead and Elementals by an additional 3%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="bf1d908a00fdd11875d8c4125363886c9490abb484620d22e64f688b650967c5",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[880]={["sourceID"]=880,["name"]="Sanctified Retribution",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholymindvision",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases the damage of all party and raid members by 1%.\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.\n\nIncreases the damage caused by Retribution Aura by 20%.",["display"]="|cffffff00Increases the damage of all party and raid members by 1%.\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.\n\n|rIncreases the damage caused by Retribution Aura by |cffffff0020%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31869,["stockText"]="Increases the damage caused by Retribution Aura by 50% and all damage caused by friendly targets affected by any of your Auras is increased by 3%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="6385072df3a7be71321f182b21f707f0406c453935ed91648a057b99710f8541",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[881]={["sourceID"]=881,["name"]="Divine Purpose",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholydivinepurpose",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Reduces the cooldown of Hand of Freedom by 2 seconds. \n\nYour Hand of Freedom spell has a 33% chance to remove all stun effects on the target. \n\nIf a stun effect is removed, the normal effect of Hand of Freedom will not be applied.\n\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Hand of Freedom now also increases the movement speed of the target by 30%.",["display"]="Reduces |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00cooldown|r |cffffff00of|r |cffffff00Hand|r |cffffff00of Freedom|r by |cffffff002|r |cffffff00seconds. \n\nYour|r Hand of Freedom spell |cffffff00has |ra |cffffff0033%|r chance to remove |cffffff00all|r |cffffff00stun|r effects on the target.|cffffff00 \n\nIf a stun effect is removed, the normal effect of Hand of Freedom will not be applied.\n\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Hand of Freedom now also increases the movement speed of the target by 30%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31871,["stockText"]="Reduces your chance to be hit by spells and ranged attacks by 2% and gives your Hand of Freedom spell a 50% chance to remove any Stun effects on the target."},{["text"]="Reduces the cooldown of Hand of Freedom by 4 seconds. \n\nYour Hand of Freedom spell has a 67% chance to remove all stun effects on the target. \n\nIf a stun effect is removed, the normal effect of Hand of Freedom will not be applied.\n\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Hand of Freedom now also increases the movement speed of the target by 30%.",["display"]="Reduces |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00cooldown|r |cffffff00of|r |cffffff00Hand|r |cffffff00of Freedom|r by |cffffff004|r |cffffff00seconds. \n\nYour|r Hand of Freedom spell |cffffff00has |ra |cffffff0067%|r chance to remove |cffffff00all|r |cffffff00stun|r effects on the target.|cffffff00 \n\nIf a stun effect is removed, the normal effect of Hand of Freedom will not be applied.\n\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Hand of Freedom now also increases the movement speed of the target by 30%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31872,["stockText"]="Reduces your chance to be hit by spells and ranged attacks by 4% and gives your Hand of Freedom spell a 100% chance to remove any Stun effects on the target."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="6d4929eec182b0fee72f67b15125baf8bab8f6cb08d7df58573cb60851e04eba",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[882]={["sourceID"]=882,["name"]="Judgements of the Wise",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitypaladinjudgementofthewise",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Your Judgements have a 33% chance to restore 15% of your base mana and grant Replenishment.\nReplenishment",["display"]="Your |cffffff00Judgements|r have a 33% chance to |cffffff00restore|r |cffffff0015%|r of your base |cffffff00mana and grant Replenishment.\nReplenishment|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31876,["stockText"]="Your damaging Judgement spells have a 33% chance to grant the Replenishment effect to up to 10 party or raid members mana regeneration equal to 1% of their maximum mana per 5 sec for 15 sec, and to immediately grant you 25% of your base mana."},{["text"]="Your Judgements have a 66% chance to restore 15% of your base mana and grant Replenishment.\nReplenishment",["display"]="Your |cffffff00Judgements|r have a 66% chance to |cffffff00restore|r |cffffff0015%|r of your base |cffffff00mana and grant Replenishment.\nReplenishment|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31877,["stockText"]="Your damaging Judgement spells have a 66% chance to grant the Replenishment effect to up to 10 party or raid members mana regeneration equal to 1% of their maximum mana per 5 sec for 15 sec, and to immediately grant you 25% of your base mana."},{["text"]="Your damaging Judgement spells have a 100% chance to grant Replenishment and immediately grant you 15% of your base mana.\nReplenishment",["display"]="Your damaging Judgement spells have a 100% chance to grant Replenishment and immediately grant you |cffffff0015%|r of your base mana.|cffffff00\nReplenishment|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31878,["stockText"]="Your damaging Judgement spells have a 100% chance to grant the Replenishment effect to up to 10 party or raid members mana regeneration equal to 1% of their maximum mana per 5 sec for 15 sec, and to immediately grant you 25% of your base mana."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="72fa8e62c88ef0498128a699d0e02dd5730a2263edab52467839ea34f0717d3b",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[883]={["sourceID"]=883,["name"]="Fanaticism",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyfanaticism",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements by 10%. \n\nIncreases the damage of your Crusader Strike, Seals and Judgements on targets affected by your Execution Sentence by 7%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Crusader Strike marks the target for 8 sec, increasing the damage they take from your Seals by 10%. Judging a target that's marked or affected by Execution Sentence grants you 35% increased movement speed for 3 sec and reduces the cooldown of Execution Sentence by 10 seconds.",["display"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements |cffffff00by 10%. \n\nIncreases the damage|r of |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00Crusader|r |cffffff00Strike, Seals and Judgements on targets affected|r by |cffffff00your Execution Sentence by 7%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Crusader Strike marks the target for 8 sec, increasing the damage they take from your Seals by 10%. Judging a target that's marked or affected by Execution Sentence grants you 35% increased movement speed for 3 sec|r and reduces |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00cooldown of Execution Sentence|r by |cffffff0010|r |cffffff00seconds.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31879,["stockText"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements capable of a critical hit by 6% and reduces threat caused by all actions by 10% except when under the effects of Righteous Fury."},{["text"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements by 20%.  \n\nIncreases the damage of your Crusader Strike, Seals and Judgements on targets affected by your Execution Sentence by 14%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Crusader Strike marks the target for 8 sec, increasing the damage they take from your Seals by 10%. Judging a target that's marked or affected by Execution Sentence grants you 35% increased movement speed for 3 sec and reduces the cooldown of Execution Sentence by 10 seconds.",["display"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements |cffffff00by 20%.  \n\nIncreases the damage|r of |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00Crusader|r |cffffff00Strike, Seals and Judgements on targets affected|r by |cffffff00your Execution Sentence by 14%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Crusader Strike marks the target for 8 sec, increasing the damage they take from your Seals by 10%. Judging a target that's marked or affected by Execution Sentence grants you 35% increased movement speed for 3 sec|r and reduces |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00cooldown of Execution Sentence|r by |cffffff0010|r |cffffff00seconds.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31880,["stockText"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements capable of a critical hit by 12% and reduces threat caused by all actions by 20% except when under the effects of Righteous Fury."},{["text"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements by 30%. \n\nIncreases the damage of your Crusader Strike, Seals and Judgements on targets affected by your Execution Sentence by 20%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Crusader Strike marks the target for 8 sec, increasing the damage they take from your Seals by 10%. Judging a target that's marked or affected by Execution Sentence grants you 35% increased movement speed for 3 sec and reduces the cooldown of Execution Sentence by 10 seconds when used against monsters.",["display"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements |cffffff00by 30%. \n\nIncreases the damage|r of |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00Crusader|r |cffffff00Strike, Seals and Judgements on targets affected|r by |cffffff00your Execution Sentence by 20%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Crusader Strike marks the target for 8 sec, increasing the damage they take from your Seals by 10%. Judging a target that's marked or affected by Execution Sentence grants you 35% increased movement speed for 3 sec|r and reduces |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00cooldown of Execution Sentence|r by |cffffff0010|r |cffffff00seconds|r when |cffffff00used|r |cffffff00against|r |cffffff00monsters.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31881,["stockText"]="Increases the critical strike chance of all Judgements capable of a critical hit by 18% and reduces threat caused by all actions by 30% except when under the effects of Righteous Fury."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="40a9aef1a93577e1ae00fa2ab3688ae41dd2430b791cc465a48975e12f2a7845",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[884]={["sourceID"]=884,["name"]="Sanctity of Battle",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyholysmite",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases the damage caused by Exorcism, Crusader Strike, Divine Storm, Execution Sentence and Consecration by 5%. \n\nYou have a 33% chance when you deal damage with Exorcism to empower your next ability:\n\nHammer of Wrath - May be used regardless of the target's health and deals 35% more damage to monsters.\n\nHoly Fire - Guaranteed to critically strike but deals 10% reduced damage.\n\nFlash of Light - Guaranteed critical strike.",["display"]="Increases the damage caused by |cffffff00Exorcism, Crusader Strike, Divine Storm, Execution Sentence|r and |cffffff00Consecration|r by 5%.|cffffff00 \n\nYou have a 33% chance when you deal damage with Exorcism to empower your next ability:\n\nHammer of Wrath - May be used regardless of the target's health and deals 35% more damage to monsters.\n\nHoly Fire - Guaranteed to critically strike but deals 10% reduced damage.\n\nFlash of Light - Guaranteed critical strike.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=32043,["stockText"]="Incre