ks by 10%. This|r effect |cffffff00can|r |cffffff00only|r |cffffff00occur|r |cffffff00once|r |cffffff00every|r |cffffff0030|r |cffffff00seconds.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=33881,["stockText"]="Your critical strike chance with all spells is increased by 1% and critical strikes against you give you the Natural Perfection effect reducing all damage taken by 2%.  Stacks up to 3 times.  Lasts 8 sec."},{["text"]="Your critical strike chance with all spells is increased by 2%\n\nCapstone Bonus: Being critically struck by a spell or ability has a 100% chance to reduce the damage you take from the next 3 attacks by 10%. This effect can only occur once every 30 seconds.",["display"]="Your critical strike chance with all spells is increased by 2%|cffffff00\n\nCapstone|r |cffffff00Bonus:|r |cffffff00Being|r |cffffff00critically|r |cffffff00struck by a spell or ability has a 100% chance to reduce the damage|r you |cffffff00take|r |cffffff00from|r the |cffffff00next|r |cffffff003 attacks by 10%. This|r effect |cffffff00can|r |cffffff00only|r |cffffff00occur|r |cffffff00once|r |cffffff00every|r |cffffff0030|r |cffffff00seconds.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=33882,["stockText"]="Your critical strike chance with all spells is increased by 2% and critical strikes against you give you the Natural Perfection effect reducing all damage taken by 3%.  Stacks up to 3 times.  Lasts 8 sec."},{["text"]="Your critical strike chance with all spells is increased by 3%\n\nCapstone Bonus: Being critically struck by a spell or ability has a 100% chance to reduce the damage you take from the next 3 attacks by 10%. This effect can only occur once every 30 seconds.",["display"]="Your critical strike chance with all spells is increased by 3%|cffffff00\n\nCapstone|r |cffffff00Bonus:|r |cffffff00Being|r |cffffff00critically|r |cffffff00struck by a spell or ability has a 100% chance to reduce the damage|r you |cffffff00take|r |cffffff00from|r the |cffffff00next|r |cffffff003 attacks by 10%. This|r effect |cffffff00can|r |cffffff00only|r |cffffff00occur|r |cffffff00once|r |cffffff00every|r |cffffff0030|r |cffffff00seconds.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=33883,["stockText"]="Your critical strike chance with all spells is increased by 3% and critical strikes against you give you the Natural Perfection effect reducing all damage taken by 4%.  Stacks up to 3 times.  Lasts 8 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="037e033741cbd31a34688e5b7894f72a18b4e1f44e2ba80dc6e908c7604d5cee",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[910]={["sourceID"]=910,["name"]="Tree of Life",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidtreeoflife",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Shapeshift into the Tree of Life. \n\nWhile in this form you increase healing received by 6% for all party and raid members.\n\n Does not stack with similar effects.\n\n\nTree of Life reduces the mana cost of your Druid healing over time spells by 0%. \n\nWhile in this form, you can only cast healing spells in addition to Innervate, Barkskin, Nature's Grasp, Thorns spells, and non-offensive spells usable while shapeshifted.\n\nIf your Primary Stat is Spirit, shapeshifting into Tree of Life will free you from all movement impairing effects.",["display"]="|cffffff00Shapeshift|r into the Tree of Life.|cffffff00 \n\n|rWhile in this form you increase healing received by 6% for all party and raid |cffffff00members.\n\n Does|r |cffffff00not|r |cffffff00stack|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00similar effects.\n\n\nTree of Life reduces the mana cost of your Druid healing over time spells by 0%. \n\nWhile in this form,|r you can only cast |cffffff00healing|r spells in addition to Innervate, Barkskin, Nature's |cffffff00Grasp, Thorns spells,|r and |cffffff00non-offensive|r |cffffff00spells usable while shapeshifted.|r\n\n|cffffff00If|r |cffffff00your Primary Stat is Spirit, shapeshifting into Tree|r of |cffffff00Life|r |cffffff00will|r |cffffff00free|r |cffffff00you|r |cffffff00from|r |cffffff00all|r |cffffff00movement|r |cffffff00impairing|r effects.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=65139,["stockText"]="Reduces the mana cost of your healing over time spells by 20% and grants the ability to shapeshift into the Tree of Life. While in this form you increase healing received by 6% for all party and raid members within 100 yards, and you can only cast Restoration spells in addition to Innervate, Barkskin, Nature's Grasp and Thorns spells.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="9bb83fd950f8315b3cc999c50b57df8b8f99dfcec03cee8168859fe73abac967",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[911]={["sourceID"]=911,["name"]="Nurturing Instinct",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidhealinginstincts",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases your bonus spell healing by an amount equal to 15% of your Agility. \n\nIncreases healing done to you by 5% while in Cat, Bear and Dire Bear Form. This does not stack with other increased healing received effects.",["display"]="Increases your |cffffff00bonus spell |rhealing by |cffffff00an amount equal|r to |cffffff0015%|r of your |cffffff00Agility. \n\nIncreases|r healing done to you by |cffffff005%|r while in |cffffff00Cat,|r |cffffff00Bear and Dire Bear Form. This does not stack with other increased healing received effects.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=33872,["stockText"]="Increases your healing spells by up to 35% of your Agility, and increases healing done to you by 10% while in Cat form."},{["text"]="Increases your bonus spell healing by an amount equal to 30% of your Agility. \n\nAdditionally increases healing done to you by 10% while in Cat, Bear and Dire Bear Form. This does not stack with other increased healing received effects.",["display"]="Increases your |cffffff00bonus sp