 Metamorphosis your Hand of Gul'dan can be cast twice within 6 sec before going on cooldown.",["display"]="Reduces the cooldown of your Demonic Empowerment, Metamorphosis, |cffffff00Inferno, Ritual of Doom, |rand Fel Domination spells by |cffffff0020%, and the cooldown of your Demonic Leap by 10 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: While in Metamorphosis your Hand of Gul'dan can be cast twice within 6 sec before going on cooldown.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=63121,["stockText"]="Reduces the cooldown of your Demonic Empowerment, Metamorphosis, and Fel Domination spells by 20%."},{["text"]="Reduces the cooldown of your Demonic Empowerment, Metamorphosis, Inferno, Ritual of Doom, and Fel Domination spells by 30%, and the cooldown of your Demonic Leap by 15 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: While in Metamorphosis your Hand of Gul'dan can be cast twice within 6 sec before going on cooldown.",["display"]="Reduces the cooldown of your Demonic Empowerment, Metamorphosis, |cffffff00Inferno, Ritual of Doom, |rand Fel Domination spells by |cffffff0030%, and the cooldown of your Demonic Leap by 15 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: While in Metamorphosis your Hand of Gul'dan can be cast twice within 6 sec before going on cooldown.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=63123,["stockText"]="Reduces the cooldown of your Demonic Empowerment, Metamorphosis, and Fel Domination spells by 30%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="f1200aa9faffdfa1b9c251040a667267720007813b2bd7cccc98c44d89b8a752",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[983]={["sourceID"]=983,["name"]="Demonic Pact",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowdemonicpact",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases your Fire and Shadow spell damage done by 1%. \n\nCapstone Bonus: Your summoned demon's critical strikes apply the Demonic Pact to itself and its owner, increasing spell damage by 5%. \n\nCasts a lesser effect to party and raid members increasing spell power and intellect. Does not stack with other similar effects. This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons.",["display"]="Increases your|cffffff00 Fire and Shadow|r spell damage |cffffff00done |rby |cffffff001%. \n\nCapstone|r |cffffff00Bonus:|r |cffffff00Your|r |cffffff00summoned|r |cffffff00demon's critical strikes|r apply the Demonic Pact |cffffff00to itself and its owner, increasing spell damage by 5%. \n\nCasts a lesser |reffect to party |cffffff00and|r raid |cffffff00members|r |cffffff00increasing|r spell power |cffffff00and|r |cffffff00intellect.|r |cffffff00Does|r |cffffff00not|r |cffffff00stack|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00other|r |cffffff00similar|r |cffffff00effects.|r This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47236,["stockText"]="Increases your spell damage by 2%, and your pet's criticals apply the Demonic Pact effect to your party or raid members. Demonic Pact increases spell power by 2% of your Spell Damage for 45 sec. This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons."},{["text"]="Increases your Fire and Shadow spell damage done by 2%. \n\nCapstone Bonus: Your summoned demon's critical strikes apply the Demonic Pact to itself and its owner, increasing spell damage by 5%. \n\nCasts a lesser effect to party and raid members increasing spell power and intellect. Does not stack with other similar effects. This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons.",["display"]="Increases your|cffffff00 Fire and Shadow|r spell damage |cffffff00done |rby |cffffff002%. \n\nCapstone|r |cffffff00Bonus:|r |cffffff00Your|r |cffffff00summoned|r |cffffff00demon's critical strikes|r apply the Demonic Pact |cffffff00to itself and its owner, increasing spell damage by 5%. \n\nCasts a lesser |reffect to party |cffffff00and|r raid |cffffff00members|r |cffffff00increasing|r spell power |cffffff00and|r |cffffff00intellect.|r |cffffff00Does|r |cffffff00not|r |cffffff00stack|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00other|r |cffffff00similar|r |cffffff00effects.|r This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47237,["stockText"]="Increases your spell damage by 4%, and your pet's criticals apply the Demonic Pact effect to your party or raid members. Demonic Pact increases spell power by 4% of your Spell Damage for 45 sec. This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons."},{["text"]="Increases your Fire and Shadow spell damage done by 3%. \n\nCapstone Bonus: Your summoned demon's critical strikes apply the Demonic Pact to itself and its owner, increasing spell damage by 5%. \n\nCasts a lesser effect to party and raid members increasing spell power and intellect. Does not stack with other similar effects. This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons.",["display"]="Increases your|cffffff00 Fire and Shadow|r spell damage |cffffff00done |rby |cffffff003%. \n\nCapstone|r |cffffff00Bonus:|r |cffffff00Your|r |cffffff00summoned|r |cffffff00demon's critical strikes|r apply the Demonic Pact |cffffff00to itself and its owner, increasing spell damage by 5%. \n\nCasts a lesser |reffect to party |cffffff00and|r raid |cffffff00members|r |cffffff00increasing|r spell power |cffffff00and|r |cffffff00intellect.|r |cffffff00Does|r |cffffff00not|r |cffffff00stack|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00other|r |cffffff00similar|r |cffffff00effects.|r This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47238,["stockText"]="Increases your spell damage by 6%, and your pet's criticals apply the Demonic Pact effect to your party or raid members. Demonic Pact increases spell power by 6% of your Spell Damage for 45 sec. This effect has a 20 sec cooldown. Does not work on Enslaved demons."},{["missingRank"]=true},{["missingRank"]=true}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]