y, Mind Sear and Mind Blast casts have a 33% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the target.\n\nReduces the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 10%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: If your Devouring Plague is dispelled within 3 seconds after being applied, it deals damage to the dispeller and makes them vulnerable to Diseases, increasing their duration by 25%. This effect stacks up to 3 times.",["display"]="|cffffff00Mind Flay,|r Mind |cffffff00Sear|r |cffffff00and Mind Blast casts have|r a 33% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the |cffffff00target.\n\nReduces|r the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 10%.|cffffff00\n\nCapstone Bonus: If your Devouring Plague is dispelled within 3 seconds after being applied, it deals damage to the dispeller and makes them vulnerable to Diseases, increasing their duration by 25%. This effect stacks up to 3 times.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47580,["stockText"]="Your Mind Flay has a 33% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the target, and reduces the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 10%."},{["text"]="Mind Flay, Mind Sear and Mind Blast casts have a 66% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the target.\n\nReduces the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 20%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: If your Devouring Plague is dispelled within 3 seconds after being applied, it deals damage to the dispeller and makes them vulnerable to Diseases, increasing their duration by 25%. This effect stacks up to 3 times.",["display"]="|cffffff00Mind Flay,|r Mind |cffffff00Sear|r |cffffff00and Mind Blast casts have|r a 66% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the |cffffff00target.\n\nReduces|r the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 20%.|cffffff00\n\nCapstone Bonus: If your Devouring Plague is dispelled within 3 seconds after being applied, it deals damage to the dispeller and makes them vulnerable to Diseases, increasing their duration by 25%. This effect stacks up to 3 times.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47581,["stockText"]="Your Mind Flay has a 66% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the target, and reduces the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 20%."},{["text"]="Mind Flay, Mind Sear and Mind Blast casts have a 100% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the target.\n\nReduces the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 30%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: If your Devouring Plague is dispelled within 3 seconds after being applied, it deals damage to the dispeller and makes them vulnerable to Diseases, increasing their duration by 25%. This effect stacks up to 3 times.",["display"]="|cffffff00Mind Flay,|r Mind |cffffff00Sear|r |cffffff00and Mind Blast casts have|r a 100% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the |cffffff00target.\n\nReduces|r the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 30%.|cffffff00\n\nCapstone Bonus: If your Devouring Plague is dispelled within 3 seconds after being applied, it deals damage to the dispeller and makes them vulnerable to Diseases, increasing their duration by 25%. This effect stacks up to 3 times.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47582,["stockText"]="Your Mind Flay has a 100% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the target, and reduces the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 30%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="e2b223c8eb7164dd12508230495686807130fa7c66e0df971c788226e022fc42",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[1005]={["sourceID"]=1005,["name"]="Dispersion",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowdispersion",["ranks"]={{["text"]="You disperse into pure Shadow energy, reducing all damage taken by 90%.  You are unable to attack or cast spells, but you regenerate 4% mana every 1 sec for 5 sec. Dispersion can be cast while stunned, feared or silenced and clears all snare and movement impairing effects when cast.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["display"]="You disperse into pure Shadow energy, reducing all damage taken by 90%.  You are unable to attack or cast spells, but you regenerate |cffffff004%|r mana every 1 sec for |cffffff005|r sec. Dispersion can be cast while stunned, feared or silenced and clears all snare and movement impairing effects when |cffffff00cast.\n\nThis|r |cffffff00ability|r |cffffff00is|r |cffffff00usable|r while |cffffff00shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47585,["stockText"]="You disperse into pure Shadow energy, reducing all damage taken by 90%.  You are unable to attack or cast spells, but you regenerate 6% mana every 1 sec for 6 sec. Dispersion can be cast while stunned, feared or silenced and clears all snare and movement impairing effects when cast, and makes you immune to them while dispersed."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="544163c10b2760f7f5c4731901305e58fa1cf39cb17013fb3d85e1661a61b404",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[1006]={["sourceID"]=1006,["name"]="Guardian Spirit",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyguardianspirit",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Calls upon a guardian spirit to watch over the friendly target. The spirit increases the healing received by the target by 40%, and also prevents the target from dying by sacrificing itself, only up to a maximum of 15% of target's total health. This sacrifice terminates the effect but heals the target of 25% of their maximum health. Lasts 10 sec.",["display"]="Calls upon a guardian spirit to watch over the friendly target. The spirit increases the healing received by the target by 40%, and also prevents the target from dying by sacrificing |cffffff00itself, only up to a maximum of 15% of target's total health. |rThis sacrifice terminates the effect but heals the target of |cffffff0025%|r of their maximum health. Lasts 10 sec.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47788,["stockText"]="Calls upon a guardian spirit to watch over the friendly target. The spirit increases the healing received by the target by 40%, and also prevents the target from dying by sacrificing itself.  This sacrifice terminates the effect but heals the target of 50% of their maximum health. Lasts 10 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="3537a2cc481802806129a9b333609a8c039b45644e9fd7bbe84fe47bcb795736",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[1007]={["sourceID"]=1007,["name"]="Improved Moonkin Form",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidimprovedmoonkinform",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Your Moonkin Aura grants affected targets 1% spell haste. \n\nDoes not stack with similar effects.\n\n\nIn Moonkin Form, you gain 6% of your spirit as extra spell damage and increase armor from cloth and leather by 14%.",["display"]="Your Moonkin Aura |cffffff00grants|r affected targets |cffffff001% spell haste. \n\nDoes not stack with similar effects.\n\n\nIn Moonkin Form, you|r gain |cffffff006%|r of your spirit as |cffffff00extra|r spell |cffffff00damage and increase armor from cloth and leather by 14%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=48384,["stockText"]="Your Moonkin Aura also causes affected targets to gain 1% haste and you to gain 10% of your spirit as additional spell damage."},{["text"]="Your Moonkin Aura also causes affected targets to gain 2% spell haste. \n\nDoes not stack with similar effects.\n\n\nIn Moonkin Form, you to gain 12% of your spirit as additional spell damage, and increases your armor contribution from cloth and leather items in Moonkin Form by 27%.",["display"]="Your Moonkin Aura also causes affected targets to gain 2% |cffffff00spell|r |cffffff00haste. \n\nDoes not stack with similar effects.\n\n\nIn Moonkin Form,|r