tarfire grants|r you a 100% chance |cffffff00to|r |cffffff00increase the|r damage |cffffff00of your Wrath and Starsurge|r by |cffffff0030% for 15 seconds.\n\nDealing damage with |rWrath |cffffff00grants|r you a |cffffff00100%|r chance |cffffff00to|r |cffffff00increase|r your critical strike chance with Starfire |cffffff00and Starsurge |rby |cffffff0030%|r |cffffff00for|r 15 |cffffff00seconds.\n\n|rBoth effects cannot occur |cffffff00at the same time and each effect can only occur once every 30 seconds.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=48525,["stockText"]="When you critically hit with Starfire, you have a 100% chance of increasing damage done by Wrath by 40%. When you critically hit with Wrath, you have a ${100*0.6}% chance of increasing your critical strike chance with Starfire by 40%. Each effect lasts 15 sec and each has a separate 30 sec cooldown.  Both effects cannot occur simultaneously."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="98fa3a71b8d415e206b47eaa477b8b9e941bc2902ddc4cea09d6eff5d6614e2a",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[1020]={["sourceID"]=1020,["name"]="Gale Winds",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidgalewinds",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases your Hurricane and Typhoon damage by 10% and reduces their mana costs by 20%. \n\nIncreases the range of your Entangling Roots and Cyclone by 2 yards.",["display"]="Increases your Hurricane and Typhoon |cffffff00damage|r by |cffffff0010%|r and |cffffff00reduces their mana costs by 20%. \n\nIncreases|r the range of your |cffffff00Entangling Roots and |rCyclone by 2 yards.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=48488,["stockText"]="Increases damage done by your Hurricane and Typhoon spells by 15%, and increases the range of your Cyclone spell by 2 yards."},{["text"]="Increases your Hurricane and Typhoon damage by 20% and reduces their mana costs by 40%. \n\nIncreases the range of your Entangling Roots and Cyclone by 4 yard