es the critical strike damage bonus of your Aimed Shot, Arcane Shot, Steady Shot, Kill Shot and Chimera Shot by 10%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="f5b1bb1354abb52a2e421d85455d25d5b00e52ba3302bde02b54fbb66c325b69",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[1068]={["sourceID"]=1068,["name"]="Chimera Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityhunterchimerashot2",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Deals 230% ranged weapon damage, refreshing the current Stings on your target and triggering extra effects if the Stings are active:\n\nSerpent Sting - Instantly deals 90% of the damage done by your Serpent Sting. \n\nViper Sting - Instantly restores mana to you equal to 30% of the total amount drained by your Viper Sting.\n\nScorpid Sting - Disarms the target for 4 sec. This effect cannot occur more than once per 1 minute.",["display"]="|cffffff00Deals|r |cffffff00230%|r |cffffff00ranged|r weapon damage, refreshing the current |cffffff00Stings|r on your target and triggering |cffffff00extra|r |cffffff00effects if the Stings are active:|r\n\nSerpent Sting - Instantly deals |cffffff0090%|r of the damage done by your Serpent Sting.|cffffff00 \n\n|rViper Sting - Instantly restores mana to you equal to |cffffff0030%|r of the total amount drained by your Viper Sting.\n\nScorpid Sting - |cffffff00Disarms|r the target for |cffffff004|r sec. This effect cannot occur more than once per 1 minute.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=53209,["stockText"]="You deal 125% weapon damage, refreshing the current Sting on your target and triggering an effect:\n\nSerpent Sting - Instantly deals 40% of the damage done by your Serpent Sting.\n\nViper Sting - Instantly restores mana to you equal to 60% of the total amount drained by your Viper Sting.\n\nScorpid Sting - Attempts to Disarm the target for 10 sec. This effect cannot occur more than once per 1 minute."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="4ec418b56e