ing Wrath by 60 secs and while affected by Avenging Wrath 50% of all damage caused bypasses damage reduction effects."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="773fc21c3bf9f7e7acee0a9f2c6028d400ce2810ea848fa7a03845a2705a6995",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[1080]={["sourceID"]=1080,["name"]="Swift Retribution",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitypaladinswiftretribution",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases the spell haste of all party and raid members by 1%. \n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects. \n\n\nWhen you use Crusader Strike or Judgement you gain 1% melee and spell haste. This effect stacks three times and lasts for 10 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Each stack of Swift Retribution also increases the damage of your Holy Fire and Smite by 5%.",["display"]="|cffffff00Increases|r |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00spell|r |cffffff00haste|r |cffffff00of|r |cffffff00all party|r and |cffffff00raid|r |cffffff00members|r by 1%.|cffffff00 \n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects. \n\n\nWhen you use Crusader Strike or Judgement you gain 1% melee and spell haste. This effect stacks three times and lasts for 10 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Each stack of Swift Retribution also increases the damage of your Holy Fire and Smite by 5%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=53379,["stockText"]="Your auras also increase casting, ranged and melee attack speeds by 1%."},{["text"]="Increases the spell haste of all party and raid members by 2%. \n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects. \n\n\n\nWhen you use Crusader Strike or Judgement you gain 2% melee and spell haste. This effect stacks three times and lasts for 10 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Each stack of Swift Retribution also increases the damage of your Holy Fire and Smite by 5%.",["display"]="|cffffff00Increases|r |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00spell|r |cffffff00haste|r |cffffff00of|r |cffffff00all party|r and |cffffff00raid|r |cffffff00members|r by 2%.|cffff