]="Fills you with the embrace of Shadow energy, causing you to be healed for 10% and other party members to be healed for 2% of any single-target Priest Shadow spell damage you deal. \n\nEither heal can not exceed 5% of the maximum health of the caster.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["display"]="Fills you with the embrace of Shadow energy, causing you to be healed for |cffffff0010%|r and other party members to be healed for |cffffff002%|r of any single-target|cffffff00 Priest|r Shadow spell damage you |cffffff00deal. \n\nEither|r |cffffff00heal|r |cffffff00can|r |cffffff00not exceed 5% of the maximum health of the caster.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=15286,["stockText"]="Fills you with the embrace of Shadow energy, causing you to be healed for 15% and other party members to be healed for 3% of any single-target Shadow spell damage you deal for 1800 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="60e3f2083cf3ce32d88fd9bf3524d761954951c55fc707ba4984bdec7a56a812",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000501]={["sourceID"]=550,["name"]="Mind Flay",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowsiphonmana",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Assault the target's mind with Shadow energy, causing ${31*3} Shadow damage over 3 sec and slowing their movement speed by 50%.",["display"]="Assault the target's mind with Shadow energy, causing |cffffff00${31*3}|r Shadow damage over 3 sec and slowing their movement speed by 50%.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${31*3}"},["sourceSpell"]=15407,["stockText"]="Assault the target's mind with Shadow energy, causing ${15*3} Shadow damage over 3 sec and slowing their movement speed by 50%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="91cad344b4e7d2ee01626d90d1387630754d391169426ff60624dc58dc32264f",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000521]={["sourceID"]=551,["name"]="Shadowform",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowshadowform",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Assume a Shadowform, increasing your Shadow damage by 10%. \n\nYou may not cast healing, or Priest Holy spells while in this form. \n\nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Grants Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Vampiric Touch the ability to benefit from haste.\nOtherwise: Grants the periodic damage from your Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague, and Vampiric Touch spells the ability to critically hit and benefit from haste.",["display"]="Assume a Shadowform, increasing your Shadow damage by |cffffff0010%. \n\nYou|r may not cast|cffffff00 healing, or Priest|r Holy spells while in this |cffffff00form. \n\nWhen|r |cffffff00Wildcard:|r |cffffff00Rune|r |cffffff00of Random is active: Grants Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague|r and |cffffff00Vampiric|r |cffffff00Touch the ability to benefit from haste.\nOtherwise: |rGrants the periodic damage from your Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague, and Vampiric Touch spells the ability to critically hit and benefit from haste.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=15473,["stockText"]="Assume a Shadowform, increasing your Shadow damage by 15%, reducing all damage done to you by 15% and threat generated by 30%.  However, you may not cast Holy spells while in this form except Cure Disease and Abolish Disease.  Grants the periodic damage from your Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague, and Vampiric Touch spells the ability to critically hit for 100% increased damage and grants Devouring Plague and Vampiric Touch the ability to benefit from haste."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="f353835b11627712bdd17e561d72d23c570914acf40866a1e03640b482db89a4",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000541]={["sourceID"]=552,["name"]="Silence",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowimpphaseshift",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Silences the target, preventing them from casting spells for 4 sec. Non-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec.\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="Silences the target, preventing them from casting spells for |cffffff004|r sec.|cffffff00 |rNon-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec.|cffffff00\n\nThis spell cannot miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=15487,["stockText"]="Silences the target, preventing them from casting spells for 5 sec.  Non-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="df40c9d17f90bfd6d4c01888f11410c783e2db0b82d798b251f491e33314ca2d",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000573]={["sourceID"]=560,["name"]="Elemental Mastery",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnaturewispheal",["ranks"]={{["text"]="When activated, your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Lava Burst spell becomes an instant cast spell and costs no mana. In addition, you gain 10% spell haste for 15 sec.\n\nDoes not stack with other similar cast speed increasing effects.",["display"]="When activated, your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Lava Burst spell becomes an instant cast |cffffff00spell and costs no mana.|r In addition, you gain |cffffff0010%|r spell haste for 15 sec.|cffffff00\n\nDoes|r |cffffff00not|r |cffffff00stack|r with |cffffff00other|r |cffffff00similar cast speed increasing effects.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=16166,["stockText"]="When activated, your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Lava Burst spell becomes an instant cast spell. In addition, you gain 15% spell haste for 15 sec. Elemental Mastery shares a cooldown with Nature's Swiftness."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="de9fa027729e8c44ec41ec68cbee7d2062337ba49cd2d1fd267b996f12d58a4d",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000582]={["sourceID"]=564,["name"]="Tidal Force",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellfrostfrostbolt",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Call upon the power of the Tides to empower your heals for 10 sec.\n\nHealing Wave: Heals the target again for 30% of the original amount healed after 1 second.\n\nLesser Healing Wave: Increases your healing on the target by 5% for 8 seconds, stacks up to 3 times.\n\nChain Heal: No longer diminishes in healing with each jump.\n\nHealing Rain: Duration is increased by 50%.",["display"]="|cffffff00Call upon|r the |cffffff00power|r of |cffffff00the Tides to empower |ryour |cffffff00heals for 10 sec.\n\n|rHealing |cffffff00Wave:|r |cffffff00Heals the target again for 30% of the original amount healed after 1 second.\n\n|rLesser Healing |cffffff00Wave:|r |cffffff00Increases|r |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00healing on the target|r by |cffffff005%|r |cffffff00for|r |cffffff008|r |cffffff00seconds,|r |cffffff00stacks|r |cffffff00up|r |cffffff00to 3 times.\n\nChain Heal: No longer diminishes in healing with each jump.\n\nHealing Rain: Duration is increased|r by |cffffff0050%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=55198,["stockText"]="Increases the critical effect chance of your Healing Wave, Lesser Healing Wave and Chain Heal by 60%. Each critical heal reduces the chance by 20%. Lasts 20 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="e102c94dca8c676b4f4f1162bb615cdb8f6af68247e7dcc4359b1409ec7c2d52",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000590]={["sourceID"]=570,["name"]="Mana Tide Totem",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellfrostsummonwaterelemental",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Summons a Mana Tide Totem with 10% of the caster's health at the feet of the caster for ${13 sec-1} sec that restores 5% of total mana every 3 seconds to group members within 30 yards.This ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["display"]="Summons a Mana Tide Totem with 10% of the caster's health at the feet of the caster for ${13 sec-1} sec that restores |cffffff005%|r of total mana every 3 seconds to group members within 30 |cffffff00yards.This ability is usable while shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${13"},["sourceSpell"]=16190,["stockText"]="Summons a Mana Tide Totem with 10% of the caster's health at the feet of the caster for ${13 sec-1} sec that restores $<mana>% of total mana every 3 seconds to group members within 30 yards."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="30801df6f47d13693788da132fd1b4d6bf8159ca859296bb6016584e50fd9abe",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000591]={["sourceID"]=571,["name"]="Nature's Swiftness",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnatureravenform",["ranks"]={{["text"]="When activated, your next Shaman Nature spell with a base casting time less than 10 sec. becomes an instant cast spell and increases your cast speed by 10% for 20 sec.\nDoes not stack with other similar cast speed increasing effects.",["display"]="When activated, your next|cffffff00 Shaman|r Nature spell with a base casting time less than 10 sec. becomes an instant cast |cffffff00spell|r |cffffff00and|r |cffffff00increases|r |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00cast|r |cffffff00speed by 10% for 20 sec.\nDoes not stack|r with |cffffff00other|r |cffffff00similar cast speed increasing effects.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=16188,["stockText"]="When activated, your next Nature spell with a base casting time less than 10 sec. becomes an instant cast spell. Nature's Swiftness shares a cooldown with Elemental Mastery."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="5e43ca2e3589c526da056fb11b41f513a7618cf12233e031f6e536dabcc5d58b",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000616]={["sourceID"]=586,["name"]="Spirit Weapons",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellfrostfrostbrand",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases the damage caused by your Frostbrand Weapon and Flametongue Weapon effect by 10%.\n\nIncreases the bonus damage of Lava Lash when your off-hand Weapon is enchanted with Flametongue Weapon by 5%.",["display"]="|cffffff00Increases|r |cffffff00the|r |cffffff00damage|r |cffffff00caused|r |cffffff00by|r |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00Frostbrand|r |cffffff00Weapon|r and |cffffff00Flametongue|r |cffffff00Weapon|r |cffffff00effect|r by |cffffff0010%.\n\nIncreases the bonus damage of Lava Lash when your off-hand Weapon is enchanted with Flametongue Weapon by 5%.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=16268,["stockText"]="Gives a chance to parry enemy melee attacks and reduces all threat generated by 30%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="8901df505a2aacf8448538fb7be99971d56653d3b8a8fea6dfa59e84a1cb58b4",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[20000681]={["sourceID"]=591,["name"]="Hemorrhage",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowlifedrain",["ranks"]={{["text"]="An instant strike that deals 100% weapon damage (${100*1.75}% if a dagger is equipped) (${100*0.85}% if a two-hander is equipped) and causes the target to hemorrhage, increasing any Physical damage dealt to the target by up to $<bonus>. Lasts 10 charges or 15 sec. Awards 1 combo point.",["display"]="An instant strike that deals |cffffff00100%|r weapon damage |cffffff00(${100*1.75}%|r if a dagger|cffffff00 is equipped) (${100*0.85}% if a two-hander|r is equipped) and causes the target to hemorrhage, increasing any Physical damage dealt to the target by up to $<bonus>.|cffffff00 |rLasts 10 charges or 15 sec.|cffffff00 |rAwards 1 combo point.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"$<bonus>.","${100*0.85}%","${100*1.75}%"},["sourceSpell"]=16511,["stockText"]="An instant strike that deals 110% weapon damage (${110*1.45}% if a dagger is equipped) and causes the target to hemorrhage, increasing any Physical damage dealt to the target by up to $<bonus>.  Lasts 10 charges or 15 sec.  Awards 1 combo point."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="acacc29b5ecc3720cc52888762ba9c65232dade385a451008f285f86f97d4f0f",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000788]={["sourceID"]=602,["name"]="Insect Swarm",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnatureinsectswarm",["ranks"]={{["text"]="The enemy target is swarmed by insects, causing 138 Nature damage over 12 sec.When Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: \n\nPeriodic damage from Insect Swarm can critically strike while in Wildcard",["display"]="The enemy target is swarmed by insects, causing |cffffff00138|r Nature damage over 12 |cffffff00sec.When Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: \n\nPeriodic damage from Insect Swarm can critically strike while in Wildcard|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=5570,["stockText"]="The enemy target is swarmed by insects, decreasing their chance to hit by 3% and causing 144 Nature damage over 12 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="dda56ce301b3d88a6460e55a111eee05b0e6036c8f71a605eeea4a42b2919abc",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000793]={["sourceID"]=606,["name"]="Moonkin Form",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnatureforceofnature",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases armor from cloth and leather by 40%, damage taken while stunned is reduced by 0%. Your direct damaging spells have a 33% chance to regenerate 2% of your total mana.\n\nAll party and raid members gain 5% increased spell critical effect chance. Does not stack with similar effects.\n\nCasting any healing spell will take you out of Moonkin Form.",["display"]="|cffffff00Increases|r armor from |cffffff00cloth|r |cffffff00and|r |cffffff00leather|r by |cffffff0040%,|r damage taken while stunned is reduced by |cffffff000%.|r |cffffff00Your|r |cffffff00direct|r |cffffff00damaging|r |cffffff00spells|r have a |cffffff0033% |rchance to regenerate 2% of your total mana.|cffffff00\n\nAll party and raid members gain 5% increased spell critical effect chance. Does not stack with similar effects.\n\nCasting any healing spell will take you out of|r Moonkin |cffffff00Form.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=24858,["stockText"]="Shapeshift into Moonkin Form.  While in this form the armor contribution from items is increased by 370%, damage taken while stunned is reduced by 15%, and all party and raid members within 100 yards have their spell critical chance increased by 5%.  Single target spell critical strikes in this form have a chance to instantly regenerate 2% of your total mana.  The Moonkin can not cast healing or resurrection spells while shapeshifted.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="a15984fbaf0ea8b80ceda87b6fcd8869bca97a5c8503b59b56203e45e6b37007",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20000801]={["sourceID"]=613,["name"]="Primal Fury",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityracialcannibalize",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Gives you a 50% chance to gain an additional 5 Rage anytime you get a critical strike while in Bear and Dire Bear Form.\n\nYour critical strikes from Cat Form abilities that add combo points have a 50% chance to add an additional combo point.",["display"]="Gives you a 50% chance to gain an additional 5 Rage anytime you get a critical strike while in Bear and Dire Bear |cffffff00Form.\n\nYour|r critical strikes from Cat Form abilities that add combo points|cffffff00 |rhave a 50% chance to add an additional combo point.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=37116,["stockText"]="Gives you a 50% chance to gain an additional 5 Rage anytime you get a critical strike while in Bear and Dire Bear Form and your critical strikes from Cat Form abilities that add combo points  have a 50% chance to add an additional combo point."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="a56362d8ce0d8def06a1381a05d4e12d96c4b67b14474df4097721a490189c8d",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[20000809]={[