"]="A strike that becomes active after parrying an opponent's attack.|cffffff00 |rThis attack deals |cffffff00${$RAP*0.8+50}|r damage and immobilizes the target for |cffffff002|r sec.|cffffff00 \n\n|rCounterattack cannot be blocked, dodged, or parried.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${$RAP*0.8+50}"},["sourceSpell"]=19306,["stockText"]="A strike that becomes active after parrying an opponent's attack.  This attack deals ${$AP*0.2+48} damage and immobilizes the target for 5 sec.  Counterattack cannot be blocked, dodged, or parried."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="9751d98a35b768a06542669e348fcf8ad8b9a2bcd9801a9e0e3e5941c03a5fd7",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001322]={["sourceID"]=701,["name"]="Black Arrow",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowpainspike",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Fires a Black Arrow at the target dealing ${235+($SP*0.075)+($RAP*0.075)} Shadow damage every 3 over 15 sec.",["display"]="Fires a Black Arrow at the target dealing |cffffff00${235+($SP*0.075)+($RAP*0.075)}|r Shadow damage|cffffff00 every 3|r over 15 sec.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${235+($SP*0.075)+($RAP*0.075)}"},["sourceSpell"]=3674,["stockText"]="Fires a Black Arrow at the target, increasing all damage done by you to the target by 6% and dealing ${$RAP*0.1+157*5} Shadow damage over 15 sec. Black Arrow shares a cooldown with Trap spells."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="3832fa46836e84e1b3c4a7440ae45794723a2628098616fb1d3cb8caadac85d7",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001325]={["sourceID"]=702,["name"]="Wyvern Sting",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\invspear02",["ranks"]={{["text"]="A stinging shot reduces the targets damage done by 30% for 2 sec. After the duration ends the target is put to sleep for 30 sec. Any damage will cancel the sleep effect except for Serpent Sting.\n\nLasts 6 sec vs players\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="A stinging shot |cffffff00reduces|r |cffffff00the targets damage done by 30% for 2 sec. After the duration ends|r the target|cffffff00 is put|r to sleep for 30 sec.|cffffff00 |rAny damage will cancel the |cffffff00sleep|r |cffffff00effect|r |cffffff00except|r |cffffff00for|r |cffffff00Serpent|r |cffffff00Sting.\n\nLasts|r 6 |cffffff00sec|r |cffffff00vs|r |cffffff00players\n\nThis|r |cffffff00spell|r |cffffff00cannot|r |cffffff00miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=19386,["stockText"]="A stinging shot that puts the target to sleep for 30 sec.  Any damage will cancel the effect.  When the target wakes up, the Sting causes 300 Nature damage over 6 sec.  Only one Sting per Hunter can be active on the target at a time."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="e21f6bd65d3c11df2ab906ac6469fc5bfce907d3336396562e08d5ba183b585b",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001345]={["sourceID"]=707,["name"]="Aimed Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\invspear07",["ranks"]={{["text"]="An aimed shot that deals 210% weapon damage plus ${$RAP*0.20+0} and reduces healing done to that target by 30%. Lasts 6 sec.\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.",["display"]="An aimed shot that |cffffff00deals|r |cffffff00210% weapon|r damage |cffffff00plus|r |cffffff00${$RAP*0.20+0}|r and reduces healing done to that target by |cffffff0030%. |rLasts |cffffff006|r sec.|cffffff00\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${$RAP*0.20+0}"},["sourceSpell"]=19434,["stockText"]="An aimed shot that increases ranged damage by 5 and reduces healing done to that target by 50%.  Lasts 10 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="2ad983fb3cd3fbfe380fd403b43d5686fc1d1ae9c39aae71236a15bbb19acbe1",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001353]={["sourceID"]=713,["name"]="Readiness",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityhunterreadiness",["rank