to make all affected targets immune to Silence and Interrupt effects and improve the effect of all other auras by 100%.  Lasts 6 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="1a69a895208df80654954708b3753ec242568d66f42240831c737df17c03af3a",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001441]={["sourceID"]=746,["name"]="Repentance",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyprayerofhealing",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Puts the enemy target in a state of meditation, incapacitating them for up to 60 sec (6 seconds on players), and removing the effect of Righteous Vengeance.  Any damage caused will awaken the target. \n\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="Puts the enemy target in a state of meditation, incapacitating them for up to 60 |cffffff00sec (6 seconds on players),|r and removing the effect of Righteous Vengeance.  Any damage caused will awaken the target.|cffffff00 \n\n\nThis|r |cffffff00spell|r |cffffff00cannot|r |cffffff00miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=20066,["stockText"]="Puts the enemy target in a state of meditation, incapacitating them for up to 60 sec, and removing the effect of Righteous Vengeance.  Any damage caused will awaken the target.  Usable against Demons, Dragonkin, Giants, Humanoids and Undead."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="0a9d58b37d8a0d66f7ef9ffcb5461c5618a1c73f6882865ec4d41c0c219c2082",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001481]={["sourceID"]=3410,["name"]="Seal of Command",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarriorinnerrage",["ranks"]={{["text"]="@learns:954707@\nAll main hand auto attacks and Paladin melee abilities deal ${0.18*$mw} to ${0.18*$MW} additional Holy damage to the target and up to 2 additional targets. Lasts until canceled.\n\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing ${0.19*$mw+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH} to ${0.19*$MW+0.08*$AP+0.13*$SPH} Holy damage.",["display"]="|