oFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholysummonlightwell",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Creates a Holy Lightwell.  Friendly players can click the Lightwell to restore ${214*3*$<mult>} health over 6 sec. Lightwell lasts for 90 sec or 10 charges.",["display"]="Creates a Holy Lightwell.  Friendly players can click the Lightwell to restore |cffffff00${214*3*$<mult>}|r health over 6 sec. Lightwell lasts for |cffffff0090|r sec or 10 charges.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${214*3*$<mult>}"},["sourceSpell"]=724,["stockText"]="Creates a Holy Lightwell.  Friendly players can click the Lightwell to restore ${267*3*$<mult>} health over 6 sec.  Attacks done to you equal to 30% of your total health will cancel the effect. Lightwell lasts for 180 sec or 10 charges."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="0f57ee7d60bb607cd6379a4db6c21f49c5d89f187f6b74f0b5eb8f297edd50f2",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001659]={["sourceID"]=800,["name"]="Rampage",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarriorrampage",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Increases ranged and melee critical strike chance of all party and raid members within 100 yds by 5%. \n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.",["display"]="Increases ranged and melee critical |cffffff00strike|r chance of all party and raid members within 100 yds by 5%.|cffffff00 \n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=29801,["stockText"]="Increases ranged and melee critical hit chance of all party and raid members within 100 yds by 5%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="f7eeb914b3aea8b9cb1a97308dcda3b7afb1f1336fdf0b27f3d07fd2b6771d5d",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001666]={["sourceID"]=3459,["name"]="Devastate",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\invsword11",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Sunder the target's armor causing the Sunder Armor effect. In addition, causes 120% weapon damage (${120*0.8} if a two-handed weapon is equipped) plus 4 for each application of Sunder Armor on the target. The Sunder Armor effect can stack up to 5 times.\nSunder Armor",["display"]="Sunder the target's armor causing the Sunder Armor effect.|cffffff00 |rIn addition, causes 120% weapon damage |cffffff00(${120*0.8} if a two-handed weapon is equipped) |rplus |cffffff004|r for each application of Sunder Armor on the target.|cffffff00 |rThe Sunder Armor effect can stack up to 5 times.|cffffff00\nSunder Armor|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${120*0.8}"},["sourceSpell"]=20243,["stockText"]="Sunder the target's armor causing the Sunder Armor effect.  In addition, causes 120% of weapon damage plus 58 for each application of Sunder Armor on the target.  The Sunder Armor effect can stack up to 5 times."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="1ca814503f37f1b844ed036a34245c6e7cc0d93f07228a71f8ab7edb0dd61e3c",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001670]={["sourceID"]=810,["name"]="Unstable Affliction",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowunstableaffliction3",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Shadow energy slowly destroys the target, causing 550 damage over 15 sec.  In addition, if the Unstable Affliction is dispelled it will cause 990 damage to the dispeller and silence them for 5 sec. This spell benefits from haste.\n\nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Periodic damage from Unstable Affliction can critically strike while in Wildcard",["display"]="Shadow energy slowly destroys the target, causing 550 damage over 15 sec.  In addition, if the Unstable Affliction is dispelled it will cause 990 damage to the dispeller and silence them for 5 sec. |cffffff00This|r |cffffff00spell benefits from haste.\n\nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Periodic damage from|r Unstable Affliction can |cffffff00critically|r |cffffff00strike|r |cffffff00while|r |cffffff00in|r |cffffff00Wildcard|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=30108,["stockText"]="Shadow energy slowly destroys the target, causing 550 damage over 15 sec.  In addition, if the Unstable Affliction is dispelled it will cause 990 damage to the dispeller and silence them for 5 sec. Only one Unstable Affliction or Immolate per Warlock can be active on any one target."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="2c473f6520c2196b0ba52ae0fe7e1872ffa954c5a86cbd0f2c574d990c953411",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001672]={["sourceID"]=3465,["name"]="Summon Felguard",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowsummonfelguard",["ranks"]={{["text"]="@learns:954705@\nSummons a Felguard under the command of the Warlock.",["display"]="|cffffff00@learns:954705@\n|rSummons a Felguard under the command of the Warlock.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"@learns:954705@"},["sourceSpell"]=30146,["stockText"]="Summons a Felguard under the command of the Warlock."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="50163db1bcce8187fa87d77f2a60e66b78cd3fb26b065f8c5688b3bac959dba5",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001676]={["sourceID"]=814,["name"]="Shadowfury",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowshadowfury",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Shadowfury is unleashed, causing 260 Shadow damage and stunning all enemies within 8 yds for 2.5 sec.\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="Shadowfury is unleashed, causing |cffffff00260|r Shadow damage and stunning all enemies within 8 yds for |cffffff002.5|r sec.|cffffff00\n\nThis spell cannot miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=30283,["stockText"]="Shadowfury is unleashed, causing 407 Shadow damage and stunning all enemies within 8 yds for 3 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="b57946297dbc92ae284f30385e3238690494293789f96907f6875d518138be2f",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001687]={["sourceID"]=3475,["name"]="Totem of Wrath",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellfiretotemofwrath",["ranks"]={{["text"]="@learns:92159@\nSummons a Totem of Wrath with 5 health at the feet of the caster. \n\nThe totem increases Intellect by 22 and spell power by 23 for all party and raid members, and increases the critical strike chance of all spells and attacks made against all nearby targets by 3%. Lasts 300 sec.\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["display"]="|cffffff00@learns:92159@\n|rSummons a Totem of Wrath with 5 health at the feet of the caster.|cffffff00 \n\n|rThe totem increases|cffffff00 Intellect by 22 and|r spell power by |cffffff0023|r for all party and raid members, and increases the critical strike chance of all |cffffff00spells and |rattacks |cffffff00made|r against all |cffffff00nearby|r |cffffff00targets|r |cffffff00by|r |cffffff003%. |rLasts 300 sec.|cffffff00\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"@learns:92159@"},["sourceSpell"]=30706,["stockText"]="Summons a Totem of Wrath with 5 health at the feet of the caster.  The totem increases spell power by 100 for all party and raid members, and increases the critical strike chance of all attacks by 3% against all enemies within 40 yards.  Lasts 300 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="fac5f4120350c15c0e428d20e1b173ea81ebd44351fe12dc9c4570eb220dc398",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001690]={["sourceID"]=824,["name"]="Empowered Stormstrike",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnatureelementalprecision2",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Your Stormstrike has a 50% chance to deal an additional 25% weapon damage as Fire when you have a weapon imbued with Flametongue and an additional 25% weapon damage as Frost when you have a weapon imbued with Frostbrand. \n\nThere is a 50% chance after casting Stormstrike that your auto-attacks will deal an additional ${$AP*.0125+$SP*.04} Nature damage for 8 sec.",["display"]="|cffffff00Your|r |cffffff00Stormstrike has a 50% chance to deal an additional 25% weapon damage as Fire when you have a weapon imbued with Flametongue|r and |cffffff00an|r |cffffff00additional|r |cffffff0025%|r |cffffff00weapon|r |cffffff00damage|r |cffffff00as|r |cffffff00Frost|r |cffffff00when you have a weapon imbued with Frostbrand. \n\nThere is a 50% chance after casting Stormstrike that your auto-attacks will deal an additional ${$AP*.0125+$SP*.04} Nature damage for 8 sec.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${$AP*.0125+$SP*.04}"},["sourceSpell"]=30798,["stockText"]="Allows one-hand and off-hand weapons to be equipped in the off-hand."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="f38343576c54cb0288255bb38810539ea07d28a920864eedf65c04ad80cc5439",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[20001693]={["sourceID"]=827,["name"]="Shamanistic Rage",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnatureshamanrage",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Gives your successful melee attacks a chance to regenerate mana equal to 15% of your attack power. This spell is usable while stunned. Lasts 15 sec.\n\nThis ability is usable while Shapeshifted.",["display"]="|cffffff00Gives|r your successful melee attacks a chance to regenerate mana equal to 15% of your attack power. This spell is usable while stunned. Lasts 15 sec.|cffffff00\n\nThis ability is usable while Shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=30823,["stockText"]="Reduces all damage taken by 30% and gives your successful melee attacks a chance to regenerate mana equal to 15% of your attack power. This spell is usable while stunned. Lasts 15 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="f111af7086daf41a24a060252441938120cf995449a381b9c6db7cde7b7a43ff",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001698]={["sourceID"]=831,["name"]="Earth Shield",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnatureskinofearth",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Protects the target with an earthen shield. Lasts 600 sec or 4 charges. \n\nAttacks heal the shielded target for $<heal> (increased by 25% against monsters)and reduce casting or channel time lost when damaged by 34%. \n\nThis effect can only occur once every 3 seconds.\n\nEarth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time.",["display"]="Protects the target with an earthen |cffffff00shield.|r |cffffff00Lasts 600 sec or 4 charges. \n\nAttacks heal the shielded target for $<heal> (increased by 25% against monsters)and reduce|r casting or |cffffff00channel|r time lost when damaged by |cffffff0034%. \n\n|rThis effect can only occur once every |cffffff003|r seconds.|cffffff00\n\n|rEarth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"$<heal>"},["sourceSpell"]=974,["stockText"]="Protects the target with an earthen shield, reducing casting or channeling time lost when damaged by 30%  and causing attacks to heal the shielded target for $<heal>.  This effect can only occur once every few seconds.  6 charges.  Lasts 600 sec.  Earth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time and only one Elemental Shield can be active on a target at a time."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="367bb729b0f086e4989706d926b92456edd4b699ae4ff5664e16ffc312804786",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001719]={["sourceID"]=847,["name"]="Mutilate",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityrogueshadowstrikes",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Instantly attacks with both weapons for 145% weapon damage plus an additional 20 with each weapon.  \nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Damage is increased by 15% for each of your Poisons on the target. \nOtherwise: Damage is increased by 10% against Poisoned targets. Awards 2 combo points.",["display"]="Instantly attacks with both weapons for |cffffff00145%|r weapon damage plus an additional |cffffff0020|r with each weapon.|cffffff00  \nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: |rDamage is increased by |cffffff0015% for each of your Poisons on the target. \nOtherwise: Damage is increased by 10%|r against Poisoned targets.|cffffff00 |rAwards 2 combo points.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=1329,["stockText"]="Instantly attacks with both weapons for $<percent>% weapon damage plus an additional 44 with each weapon.  Damage is increased by 20% against Poisoned targets.  Awards 2 combo points."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="e65cb01e3e841cbf29803990b536506dffb948e0b4f9dc59c7d76307547eb6b4",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001729]={["sourceID"]=856,["name"]="Slow",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellnatureslow",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Reduces target's movement speed by 40%, increases the time between ranged attacks by 30% and increases casting time by 15%.  Lasts 15 sec(10 versus players) Slow can only affect one target at a time.\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.",["display"]="Reduces target's movement speed by |cffffff0040%,|r increases the time between ranged attacks by |cffffff0030%|r and increases casting time by |cffffff0015%.|r  Lasts 15 |cffffff00sec(10 versus players) |rSlow can only affect one target at a time.|cffffff00\n\nDoes not stack with other similar effects.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31589,["stockText"]="Reduces target's movement speed by 60%, increases the time between ranged attacks by 60% and increases casting time by 30%.  Lasts 15 sec.  Slow can only affect one target at a time."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="21903cbd0e44cf05afa2f3fcb9501396532d9318a25cfce9f1f071eb8c6b7400",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001735]={["sourceID"]=862,["name"]="Dragon's Breath",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\invmischeaddragon01",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Targets in a cone in fron