ls by |cffffff0020%|r for 15 sec.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=31842,["stockText"]="Reduces the mana cost of all spells by 50% for 15 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="54c878963fc4c5c61fa88ccb6f35d76fcd327f87f4a63786ddd321833370f893",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001754]={["sourceID"]=878,["name"]="Avenger's Shield",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyavengersshield",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Hurls a holy shield at the enemy, dealing ${536+0.07*$SPH+0.07*$AP} to ${536+0.07*$SPH+0.07*$AP} Holy damage, Dazing them and then jumping to additional nearby enemies.  Affects $x1 total targets. Lasts 6 sec.",["display"]="Hurls a holy shield at the enemy, dealing ${536+0.07*$SPH+0.07*$AP} to ${536+0.07*$SPH+0.07*$AP} Holy damage, Dazing them and then jumping to additional nearby enemies.  Affects $x1 total targets.|cffffff00 |rLasts |cffffff006|r sec.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"$x1","${536+0.07*$SPH+0.07*$AP}"},["sourceSpell"]=31935,["stockText"]="Hurls a holy shield at the enemy, dealing ${536+0.07*$SPH+0.07*$AP} to ${536+0.07*$SPH+0.07*$AP} Holy damage, Dazing them and then jumping to additional nearby enemies.  Affects $x1 total targets.  Lasts 10 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="13be09e787df3d3f42de39db24721bc2c831ccbc1f6c97633b2ae5835a90515c",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001774]={["sourceID"]=896,["name"]="Pain Suppression",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholypainsupression",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Instantly reduces a friendly target's threat by 5%, reduces all damage taken by 35% for 8 sec. Pain Suppression has a 60% chance to resist Dispel mechanics.",["display"]="Instantly reduces a friendly target's threat by 5%, reduces all damage taken by |cffffff0035%|r for 8 sec.|cffffff00 Pain Suppression has a 60% chance to resist Dispel mechanics.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=33206,["stockText"]="Instantly reduces a friendly target's threat by 5%, reduces all damage taken by 40% and increases resistance to Dispel mechanics by 65% for 8 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="438cca05c67848fd8f74da64f7b5e9e26bf0d7365586fb5608295c5d86465fcf",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001779]={["sourceID"]=899,["name"]="Vampiric Touch",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholystoicism",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Causes 515 Shadow damage over 15 sec to your target and causes up to 10 party or raid members to gain 1% of their maximum mana per 5 sec when you deal damage from Mind Blast. In addition, if the Vampiric Touch is dispelled it will cause 824 damage to the afflicted target.\n\nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Periodic damage from Vampiric Touch can critically strike while in Wildcard",["display"]="Causes |cffffff00515|r Shadow damage over 15 sec to your target and causes up to 10 party or raid members to gain 1% of their maximum mana per 5 sec when you deal damage from Mind Blast. In addition, if the Vampiric Touch is dispelled it will cause |cffffff00824|r damage to the afflicted target.|cffffff00\n\nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Periodic damage from Vampiric Touch can critically strike while in Wildcard|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=34914,["stockText"]="Causes 450 Shadow damage over 15 sec to your target and causes up to 10 party or raid members to gain 1% of their maximum mana per 5 sec when you deal damage from Mind Blast. In addition, if the Vampiric Touch is dispelled it will cause 720 damage to the afflicted target."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="06dfb828de16a279dffcbbb4166f0c60d43ede407bf0daf5276cc64bd34cdf22",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001787]={["sourceID"]=906,["name"]="Force of Nature",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidforceofnature",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Summons 3 treants to attack enemy targets for 30 sec. Shares a cooldown with other Force of Nature spells.\n\nCan't be used while having an active pet.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["display"]="Summons 3 treants to attack enemy targets for 30 sec.|cffffff00 Shares a cooldown with other Force of Nature spells.\n\nCan't be used while having an active pet.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=33831,["stockText"]="Summons 3 treants to attack enemy targets for 30 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="c8e60425840300ab83d69c343fa444e8afbb07e6ab172c4fad4389e300a69a5b",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001791]={["sourceID"]=910,["name"]="Tree of Life",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidtreeoflife",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Shapeshift into the Tree of Life. \n\nWhile in this form you increase healing received by 6% for all party and raid members.\n\n Does not stack with similar effects.\n\n\nTree of Life reduces the mana cost of your Druid healing over time spells by 0%. \n\nWhile in this form, you can only cast healing spells in addition to Innervate, Barkskin, Nature's Grasp, Thorns spells, and non-offensive spells usable while shapeshifted.\n\nIf your Primary Stat is Spirit, shapeshifting into Tree of Life will free you from all movement impairing effects.",["display"]="|cffffff00Shapeshift|r into the Tree of Life.|cffffff00 \n\n|rWhile in this form you increase healing received by 6% for all party and raid |cffffff00members.\n\n Does|r |cffffff00not|r |cffffff00stack|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00similar effects.\n\n\nTree of Life reduces the mana cost of your Druid healing over time spells by 0%. \n\nWhile in this form,|r you can only cast |cffffff00healing|r spells in addition to Innervate, Barkskin, Nature's |cffffff00Grasp, Thorns spells,|r and |cffffff00non-offensive|r |cffffff00spells usable while shapeshifted.|r\n\n|cffffff00If|r |cffffff00your Primary Stat is Spirit, shapeshifting into Tree|r of |cffffff00Life|r |cffffff00will|r |cffffff00free|r |cffffff00you|r |cffffff00from|r |cffffff00all|r |cffffff00movement|r |cffffff00impairing|r effects.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=65139,["stockText"]="Reduces the mana cost of your healing over time spells by 20% and grants the ability to shapeshift into the Tree of Life. While in this form you increase healing received by 6% for all party and raid members within 100 yards, and you can only cast Restoration spells in addition to Innervate, Barkskin, Nature's Grasp and Thorns spells.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="9bb83fd950f8315b3cc999c50b57df8b8f99dfcec03cee8168859fe73abac967",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001796]={["sourceID"]=915,["name"]="Mangle",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidmangle2",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Mangle the target, inflicting damage and causing the target to take 30% additional damage from bleeds for 60 sec. \n\nDoes not stack with similar effects.\n\n\nThis ability can be used in Cat Form or Dire Bear Form.",["display"]="Mangle the target, inflicting damage and causing the target to take |cffffff0030% |radditional damage from |cffffff00bleeds|r for 60 sec.|cffffff00 \n\nDoes not stack with similar effects.\n\n\n|rThis ability can be used in Cat Form or Dire Bear Form.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=33917,["stockText"]="Mangle the target, inflicting damage and causing the target to take additional damage from bleed effects for 60 sec.  This ability can be used in Cat Form or Dire Bear Form."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="c5265b17bb6ccaf71766238da3771cb605776123e129081698c1fa2be9315fcb",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001808]={["sourceID"]=926,["name"]="Silencing Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitytheblackarrow",["ranks"]={{["text"]="A shot that deals 75% weapon damage and silences the target for 2 sec. Non-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec. \n\nSilencing Shot cannot trigger any procs.\n\nThis ability shares a cooldown with other interrupts.\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="A shot that deals |cffffff0075%|r weapon damage and |cffffff00silences|r the target for |cffffff002|r sec.|cffffff00 |rNon-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec.|cffffff00 \n\nSilencing Shot cannot trigger any procs.\n\nThis ability shares a cooldown with other interrupts.\n\nThis spell cannot miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=34490,["stockText"]="A shot that deals 50% weapon damage and Silences the target for 3 sec.  Non-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="187076199ffc2421be96a864ee510947607a5778f1bcff7aa354f9f0f69bc6d3",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001814]={["sourceID"]=932,["name"]="Scatter Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitygolemstormbolt",["ranks"]={{["text"]="A short-range shot that deals 50% weapon damage and disorients the target for 4 sec.  Any damage caused except for Piercing Shots and Serpent Sting will remove the effect. Turns off your attack when used.\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="A short-range shot that deals 50% weapon damage and disorients the target for 4 sec.  Any damage caused |cffffff00except for Piercing Shots and Serpent Sting |rwill remove the effect.|cffffff00 |rTurns off your attack when used.|cffffff00\n\nThis spell cannot miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=19503,["stockText"]="A short-range shot that deals 50% weapon damage and disorients the target for 4 sec.  Any damage caused will remove the effect.  Turns off your attack when used."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="4a89e8f3be1366846b5eeeaa15f1bd378518c806450575effdc5f3c72981e343",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001815]={["sourceID"]=933,["name"]="Circle of Healing",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholycircleofrenewal",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Heals up to When Glyph of Circle of Healing is active: 6\nOtherwise: 5 friendly party or raid members within 15 yards of the target for 188. Circle of Healing shares a cooldown with Wild Growth.",["display"]="Heals up to When Glyph of Circle of Healing is active: 6\nOtherwise: 5 friendly party or raid members within 15 yards of the target for |cffffff00188. Circle of Healing shares a cooldown with Wild Growth.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=34861,["stockText"]="Heals up to When Glyph of Circle of Healing is active: 6\nOtherwise: 5 friendly party or raid members within 15 yards of the target for 379."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="6a71bc957bb8a01e536cc3cce0badd71325e60ca16923f20bf371bf4016f8148",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001847]={["sourceID"]=950,["name"]="Arcane Barrage",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitymagearcanebarrage",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Launches several missiles at the enemy target, causing 459 Arcane damage.",["display"]="Launches several missiles at the enemy target, causing |cffffff00459|r Arcane damage.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=44425,["stockText"]="Launches several missiles at the enemy target, causing 470 Arcane damage."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="a0458d25b36f355cea50c2f2aeff6132585f30c6e521b1c800cdbc4c1a016a24",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001848]={["sourceID"]=951,["name"]="Fiery Payback",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitymagefierypayback",["ranks"]={{["text"]="While below 35% health your Fire damage is increased by 3%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your direct damage Fire spells heal you for a small amount when you are below 35% health. This effect can only occur once every second.",["display"]="|cffffff00While|r below 35% health |cffffff00your Fire|r damage is increased by |cffffff003%.\n\nCapstone|r |cffffff00Bonus:|r |cffffff00Your|r |cffffff00direct|r |cffffff00damage|r |cffffff00Fire|r |cffffff00spells|r |cffffff00heal|r you |cffffff00for|r a |cffffff00small|r |cffffff00amount|r |cffffff00when|r |cffffff00you|r |cffffff00are|r |cffffff00below|r |cffffff0035%|r |cffffff00health.|r |cffffff00This|r |cffffff00effect|r |cffffff00can only occur once every second.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=64353,["stockText"]="When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 10% and your Pyroblast spell's cast time is reduced by ${1750/-1000}.2 secs while the cooldown is increased by ${2500/1000}.1 secs.  In addition, melee and ranged attacks made against you have a 5% chance to disarm your attacker's main hand and ranged weapons."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="3c4d11b217495d8509a30a28c14e1220b842c9098faf9484c1c22ffc637050f7",["rankCountChanged"]=true},[20001852]={["sourceID"]=955,["name"]="Living Bomb",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitymagelivingbomb",["ranks"]={{["text"]="The target becomes a Living Bomb, taking 708 Fire damage over 12 sec.  After 12 sec or when the spell is dispelled, the target explodes dealing 353 Fire damage to all enemies within 10 yards.When Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: \n\nPeriodic damage from Living Bomb can critically strike while in Wildcard",["display"]="The target becomes a Living Bomb, taking |cffffff00708|r Fire damage over 12 sec.  After 12 sec or when the spell is dispelled, the target explodes dealing |cffffff00353|r Fire damage to all enemies within 10 |cffffff00yards.When Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: \n\nPeriodic damage from Living Bomb can critically strike while in Wildcard|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=44457,["stockText"]="The target becomes a Living Bomb, taking 612 Fire damage over 12 sec.  After 12 sec or when the spell is dispelled, the target explodes dealing 306 Fire damage to all enemies within 10 yards."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="7f1997896556b824003e1781d75dcf64e64d3ddba4567305c453100450e039ea",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001857]={["sourceID"]=960,["name"]="Deep Freeze",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitymagedeepfreeze",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Stuns the target for 2.5 seconds.  Only usable on Frozen targets.  Deals ${2393*$<mult>} to ${2393*$<mult>} damage to monsters permanently immune to stuns.",["display"]="Stuns the target for |cffffff002.5|r |cffffff00seconds.|r  Only usable on Frozen targets.  Deals |cffffff00${2393*$<mult>}|r to |cffffff00${2393*$<mult>}|r damage to |cffffff00monsters|r permanently immune to stuns.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${2393*$<mult>}"},["sourceSpell"]=44572,["stockText"]="Stuns the target for 5 sec.  Only usable on Frozen targets.  Deals ${1741*$<mult>} to ${1741*$<mult>} damage to targets permanently immune to stuns."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="5a9fe38a1d6db5d132ec4412cd2f8325704845b0212d1641a6112093c9087db0",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001863]={["sourceID"]=965,["name"]="Bladestorm",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarriorbladestorm",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Instantly Whirlwind up to 6 nearby targets and for the next 6 sec you will perform a whirlwind attack every 1 sec.  While under the effects of Bladestorm, you can move but cannot perform any other abilities but you do not feel pity or remorse or fear and you cannot be stopped unless disarmed or killed.",["display"]="Instantly Whirlwind up to |cffffff006|r nearby targets and for the next 6 sec you will perform a whirlwind attack every 1 sec.  While under the effects of Bladestorm, you can move but cannot perform any other abilities but you do not feel pity or remorse or fear and you cannot be stopped unless |cffffff00disarmed or |rkilled.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=46924,["stockText"]="Instantly Whirlwind up to 4 nearby targets and for the next 6 sec you will perform a whirlwind attack every 1 sec.  While under the effects of Bladestorm, you can move but cannot perform any other abilities but you do not feel pity or remorse or fear and you cannot be stopped unless killed."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="7c940a9af89437c8b0170d5d37c9a7823e1fe95d01fc48e48bb0ea4956944a94",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001867]={["sourceID"]=969,["name"]="Titan's Grip",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarriortitansgrip",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Allows you to wield a Two-Handed Axe, Mace, or Sword in each hand. \n\nAlso allows for a weapon to be held in the off-hand while a Staff or Polearm is equipped.\n\nAll damage dealt is reduced by 15% and your chance to hit with Auto Attacks from your Off-Hand is increased by 5%. \n\nWhile your Primary Stat is Spirit, all healing is reduced by 10%.",["display"]="Allows you to |cffffff00wield|r |cffffff00a|r |cffffff00Two-Handed|r |cffffff00Axe, Mace, or Sword in each hand. \n\nAlso allows for a weapon to be held in the off-hand while a Staff or Polearm is equipped.\n\nAll damage dealt is reduced by 15%|r and |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00chance|r |cffffff00to|r |cffffff00hit|r |cffffff00with|r |cffffff00Auto|r |cffffff00Attacks|r |cffffff00from|r your |cffffff00Off-Hand|r |cffffff00is|r |cffffff00increased by 5%. \n\nWhile your Primary Stat is Spirit, all healing|r is reduced by 10%.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=46917,["stockText"]="Allows you to equip two-handed axes, maces and swords in one hand.  While you have a two-handed weapon equipped in one hand, your physical damage done is reduced by 10%."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="bf2f6e80ba6c1228f9400a93c054e54e004e3c5d3da517a99e014935418d6f49",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001868]={["sourceID"]=970,["name"]="Heroic Fury",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityheroicleap",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Removes any movement impairing effects and refreshes the cooldown of your Intercept and Siegebreaker abilities.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["display"]="Removes any |cffffff00movement impairing|r effects and refreshes the cooldown of your Intercept |cffffff00and Siegebreaker abilities.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=60970,["stockText"]="Removes any Immobilization effects and refreshes the cooldown of your Intercept ability."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="c0eedbc03990df129cc111838a43163a1e154703ca76437047482176ff22cdba",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001872]={["sourceID"]=974,["name"]="Shockwave",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarriorshockwave",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Sends a wave of force in front of the caster, causing ${48/100*$AP} damage (based on attack power) and stunning all enemy targets in a frontal cone for 3 sec.\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="Sends a wave of force in front of the |cffffff00caster,|r causing |cffffff00${48/100*$AP}|r damage (based on attack power) and stunning all enemy targets in a frontal cone for |cffffff003|r sec.|cffffff00\n\nThis spell cannot miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${48/100*$AP}"},["sourceSpell"]=46968,["stockText"]="Sends a wave of force in front of the warrior, causing ${75/100*$AP} damage (based on attack power) and stunning all enemy targets within 10 yards in a frontal cone for 4 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="c181cc1ba12a5d1ef672ec424255c1a444c409d5473aedc4b129602283fa1393",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001880]={["sourceID"]=979,["name"]="Demonic Empowerment",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarlockdemonicempowerment",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Grants the Warlock's summoned demon Empowerment.\n\nImp - Increases the Imp's spell critical strike chance by 20% for 30 sec.\n\nVoidwalker - Increases the Voidwalker's health by 20%, and its threat generated from spells and attacks by 20% for 20 sec.\n\nSuccubus - Instantly vanishes, causing the Succubus to go into an improved Invisibility state. The vanish effect removes all stuns, snares and movement impairing effects from the Succubus.\n\nFelhunter - Dispels all magical effects from the Felhunter.\n\nFelguard - Increases the Felguard's attack speed by 20% and breaks all stun, snare and movement impairing effects and makes your Felguard immune to them for 15 sec.",["display"]="Grants the Warlock's summoned demon Empowerment.\n\nImp - Increases the Imp's spell critical strike chance by 20% for 30 sec.\n\nVoidwalker - Increases the Voidwalker's health by 20%, and its threat generated from spells and attacks by 20% for 20 sec.\n\nSuccubus - Instantly vanishes, causing the Succubus to go into an improved Invisibility state. The vanish effect removes all stuns, snares and movement impairing effects from the Succubus.\n\nFelhunter - Dispels all magical effects from the Felhunter.\n\nFelguard - Increases the Felguard's attack speed by 20% and breaks all stun, snare and movement impairing effects and makes your Felguard immune to them for 15 sec.",["changed"]=false,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47193,["stockText"]="Grants the Warlock's summoned demon Empowerment.\n\nImp - Increases the Imp's spell critical strike chance by 20% for 30 sec.\n\nVoidwalker - Increases the Voidwalker's health by 20%, and its threat generated from spells and attacks by 20% for 20 sec.\n\nSuccubus - Instantly vanishes, causing the Succubus to go into an improved Invisibility state. The vanish effect removes all stuns, snares and movement impairing effects from the Succubus.\n\nFelhunter - Dispels all magical effects from the Felhunter.\n\nFelguard - Increases the Felguard's attack speed by 20% and breaks all stun, snare and movement impairing effects and makes your Felguard immune to them for 15 sec."}},["changed"]=false,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="539cb1b05fe58ea6403f30476404ca579a1b910b52106168bb4bee5ac0120406",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001886]={["sourceID"]=984,["name"]="Metamorphosis",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowdemonform",["ranks"]={{["text"]="You transform into a Demon for 30 sec. \n\nThis form grants you some unique demon abilities in addition to your normal abilities. \n\nYou may only use spells and abilities that deal Fire or Shadow damage(and spells usable while shapeshifted) in this form.\n\nThis form increases your armor from cloth and leather by 130%.\n\nIncreases your damage by 15%.\n\nReduces the chance you'll be critically hit by melee attacks by 6% and reduces the duration of stun and snare effects by 25%. \n\nIncreases damage by 10% vs players.",["display"]="You transform into a Demon for 30 sec.|cffffff00 \n\nThis form grants you some unique demon abilities in addition to your normal abilities. \n\nYou may only use spells and abilities that deal Fire or Shadow damage(and spells usable while shapeshifted) in this form.\n\n|rThis form increases your armor |cffffff00from cloth and leather |rby |cffffff00130%.\n\nIncreases your|r damage by |cffffff0015%.\n\nReduces|r the chance you'll be critically hit by melee attacks by 6% and reduces the duration of stun and snare effects by |cffffff0025%. \n\nIncreases|r |cffffff00damage|r |cffffff00by|r |cffffff0010%|r |cffffff00vs|r |cffffff00players.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=59672,["stockText"]="You transform into a Demon for 30 sec.  This form increases your armor by 600%, damage by 20%, reduces the chance you'll be critically hit by melee attacks by 6% and reduces the duration of stun and snare effects by 50%.  You gain some unique demon abilities in addition to your normal abilities. 3 minute cooldown."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="756507f9d2039ead8bf341a9551bfc34935026f36c8e07d3013e0013ae29bd9e",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001891]={["sourceID"]=989,["name"]="Chaos Bolt",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitywarlockchaosbolt",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Sends a bolt of chaotic fire at the enemy, dealing ${1233+$ppl1+$sp*0.6+$ap*0.39} Fire damage. Chaos Bolt cannot be resisted, and pierces through all absorption, deflection, and reflection effects.",["display"]="Sends a bolt of chaotic fire at the enemy, dealing |cffffff00${1233+$ppl1+$sp*0.6+$ap*0.39}|r Fire damage. Chaos Bolt cannot be resisted, and pierces through all |cffffff00absorption, deflection, and reflection|r effects.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"${1233+$ppl1+$sp*0.6+$ap*0.39}"},["sourceSpell"]=50796,["stockText"]="Sends a bolt of chaotic fire at the enemy, dealing 1061 Fire damage. Chaos Bolt cannot be resisted, and pierces through all absorption effects."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="e1d61966c4a72a8c3cc9f232c236bdc30e12533afcfeee8bee90623788998bbe",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001897]={["sourceID"]=994,["name"]="Penance",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholypenance",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Launches a volley of holy light at the target, causing 91 Holy damage to an enemy, or 105 healing to an ally instantly and every 1 sec for 2 sec.",["display"]="Launches a volley of holy light at the target, causing |cffffff0091|r Holy damage to an enemy, or |cffffff00105|r healing to an ally instantly and every 1 sec for 2 sec.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47540,["stockText"]="Launches a volley of holy light at the target, causing 240 Holy damage to an enemy, or 756 healing to an ally instantly and every 1 sec for 2 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="071dc4b7f06bb87b4f6ee1e92bb7f51fc69719bcd142056172b4cc761c16a07d",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001908]={["sourceID"]=1003,["name"]="Psychic Horror",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowpsychichorrors",["ranks"]={{["text"]="You terrify the target, causing them to tremble in horror for 3 sec, and disarming them for 4 sec.\n\nThis spell cannot miss.",["display"]="You terrify the target, causing them to tremble in horror for 3 |cffffff00sec,|r and |cffffff00disarming|r |cffffff00them|r for |cffffff004|r sec.|cffffff00\n\nThis spell cannot miss.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=64044,["stockText"]="You terrify the target, causing them to tremble in horror for 3 sec and drop their main hand and ranged weapons for 10 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="00882700cc7636ca48372cd71d1463b4a78fc9a1dce45975766277ce2a9d9754",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001910]={["sourceID"]=1005,["name"]="Dispersion",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellshadowdispersion",["ranks"]={{["text"]="You disperse into pure Shadow energy, reducing all damage taken by 90%.  You are unable to attack or cast spells, but you regenerate 4% mana every 1 sec for 5 sec. Dispersion can be cast while stunned, feared or silenced and clears all snare and movement impairing effects when cast.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["display"]="You disperse into pure Shadow energy, reducing all damage taken by 90%.  You are unable to attack or cast spells, but you regenerate |cffffff004%|r mana every 1 sec for |cffffff005|r sec. Dispersion can be cast while stunned, feared or silenced and clears all snare and movement impairing effects when |cffffff00cast.\n\nThis|r |cffffff00ability|r |cffffff00is|r |cffffff00usable|r while |cffffff00shapeshifted.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47585,["stockText"]="You disperse into pure Shadow energy, reducing all damage taken by 90%.  You are unable to attack or cast spells, but you regenerate 6% mana every 1 sec for 6 sec. Dispersion can be cast while stunned, feared or silenced and clears all snare and movement impairing effects when cast, and makes you immune to them while dispersed."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="544163c10b2760f7f5c4731901305e58fa1cf39cb17013fb3d85e1661a61b404",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001911]={["sourceID"]=1006,["name"]="Guardian Spirit",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spellholyguardianspirit",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Calls upon a guardian spirit to watch over the friendly target. The spirit increases the healing received by the target by 40%, and also prevents the target from dying by sacrificing itself, only up to a maximum of 15% of target's total health. This sacrifice terminates the effect but heals the target of 25% of their maximum health. Lasts 10 sec.",["display"]="Calls upon a guardian spirit to watch over the friendly target. The spirit increases the healing received by the target by 40%, and also prevents the target from dying by sacrificing |cffffff00itself, only up to a maximum of 15% of target's total health. |rThis sacrifice terminates the effect but heals the target of |cffffff0025%|r of their maximum health. Lasts 10 sec.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=47788,["stockText"]="Calls upon a guardian spirit to watch over the friendly target. The spirit increases the healing received by the target by 40%, and also prevents the target from dying by sacrificing itself.  This sacrifice terminates the effect but heals the target of 50% of their maximum health. Lasts 10 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="3537a2cc481802806129a9b333609a8c039b45644e9fd7bbe84fe47bcb795736",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001917]={["sourceID"]=1012,["name"]="Wild Growth",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidflourish",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Heals up to 5 friendly party or raid members within 15 yards of the target for 273 over 7 sec. The amount healed is applied quickly at first, and slows down as the Wild Growth reaches its full duration.\n\nWild Growth shares a cooldown with Circle of Healing.\n\nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Periodic Healing from Wild Growth can critically strike while in Wildcard",["display"]="Heals up to 5 friendly party or raid members within 15 yards of the target for |cffffff00273|r over 7 sec. The amount healed is applied quickly at first, and slows down as the Wild Growth reaches its full duration.|cffffff00\n\nWild Growth shares a cooldown with Circle of Healing.\n\nWhen Wildcard: Rune of Random is active: Periodic Healing from Wild Growth can critically strike while in Wildcard|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=48438,["stockText"]="Heals up to 5 friendly party or raid members within 15 yards of the target for 686 over 7 sec. The amount healed is applied quickly at first, and slows down as the Wild Growth reaches its full duration."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="c6904e60add22674240a0996176e83c7d7d44ae89ebcba9832ceb29669f38db9",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001923]={["sourceID"]=1018,["name"]="Typhoon",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidtyphoon",["ranks"]={{["text"]="You summon a violent Typhoon that does 460 Nature damage when in contact with hostile targets, knocking them back and dazing them for 4 sec.",["display"]="You summon a violent Typhoon that does |cffffff00460|r Nature damage when in contact with hostile targets, knocking them back and dazing them for |cffffff004|r sec.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=50516,["stockText"]="You summon a violent Typhoon that does 400 Nature damage when in contact with hostile targets, knocking them back and dazing them for 6 sec."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="206f529a30ee2ceeb0b0c09c2ea697baad4e88fb947656aa249e241feb2695f7",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001926]={["sourceID"]=1021,["name"]="Starfall",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidstarfall",["ranks"]={{["text"]="You summon a flurry of stars from the sky on all targets within 20 yards of the caster, each dealing 160 Arcane damage. Also causes 25 Arcane damage to all other enemies within 5 yards of the enemy target. Maximum 16 stars. Lasts 8 sec.  \n\nShapeshifting into an animal form or mounting cancels the effect. Any effect which causes you to lose control of your character will suppress the starfall effect.",["display"]="You summon a flurry of stars from the sky on all targets within |cffffff0020|r yards of the caster, each dealing |cffffff00160|r Arcane damage. Also causes |cffffff0025|r Arcane damage to all other enemies within 5 yards of the enemy target. Maximum |cffffff0016|r stars. Lasts |cffffff008|r sec.|cffffff00  \n\n|rShapeshifting into an animal form or mounting cancels the effect. Any effect which causes you to lose control of your character will suppress the starfall effect.",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=48505,["stockText"]="You summon a flurry of stars from the sky on all targets within 30 yards of the caster, each dealing 167 Arcane damage. Also causes 26 Arcane damage to all other enemies within 5 yards of the enemy target. Maximum 20 stars. Lasts 10 sec.  Shapeshifting into an animal form or mounting cancels the effect. Any effect which causes you to lose control of your character will suppress the starfall effect."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="8e374b315e9ff798d1aa8da0486f9d516a2be0fd422a4ffa80dd4fe1dcc934cf",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001927]={["sourceID"]=1022,["name"]="Berserk",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilitydruidberserk",["ranks"]={{["text"]="When activated, this ability causes your Mangle abilities to hit up to 3 targets and have no cooldown.\n\nReduces the cost of all your Cat Form and Bear Form abilities by 50%. \n\nWhile active your Savage Defense absorb effect is doubled.\n \nCat combo point generators grant 4 additional combo points. (1 vs players). Lasts 10 sec.",["display"]="When activated, this ability causes your Mangle |cffffff00abilities|r to hit up to 3 targets and have no |cffffff00cooldown.\n\nReduces|r the cost of all your Cat Form |cffffff00and Bear Form |rabilities by 50%.|cffffff00 \n\nWhile|r |cffffff00active|r |cffffff00your|r |cffffff00Savage|r |cffffff00Defense|r |cffffff00absorb|r |cffffff00effect|r is |cffffff00doubled.\n \nCat|r |cffffff00combo|r |cffffff00point|r |cffffff00generators|r |cffffff00grant|r |cffffff004|r |cffffff00additional|r |cffffff00combo|r |cffffff00points.|r |cffffff00(1|r |cffffff00vs|r |cffffff00players).|r |cffffff00Lasts|r |cffffff0010 sec.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={},["sourceSpell"]=50334,["stockText"]="When activated, this ability causes your Mangle (Bear) ability to hit up to 3 targets and have no cooldown, and reduces the energy cost of all your Cat Form abilities by 50%.  Lasts 15 sec.  You cannot use Tiger's Fury while Berserk is active. \n\nClears the effect of Fear and makes you immune to Fear for the duration."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="ad901910ac0291524d17dfb158adb1f10b09adfdf313e8481ae320c8ff7ef1c3",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20001941]={["sourceID"]=1218,["name"]="Rune Tap",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\spelldeathknightrunetap",["ranks"]={{["text"]="Converts 1 Blood Rune into 10% of your maximum health.",["display"]="Converts 1 Blood Rune into 10% of your maximum health.",["changed"]=false,["unresolved"]={},