ly deals 40% of the damage done by your Serpent Sting.\n\nViper Sting - Instantly restores mana to you equal to 60% of the total amount drained by your Viper Sting.\n\nScorpid Sting - Attempts to Disarm the target for 10 sec. This effect cannot occur more than once per 1 minute."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="4ec418b56e0e26c091a71edef2216e14fbeca95583f93e9123cdc8f0521a076c",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20002139]={["sourceID"]=1072,["name"]="Beast Mastery",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityhunterbeastmastery",["ranks"]={{["text"]="@req:965200:@\nYou master the art of Beast training, teaching you the ability to tame Exotic pets and increasing your total amount of Pet Skill Points by 6.",["display"]="|cffffff00@req:965200:@\n|rYou master the art of Beast training, teaching you the ability to tame Exotic pets and increasing your total amount of Pet Skill Points by |cffffff006.|r",["changed"]=true,["unresolved"]={"@req:965200:@"},["sourceSpell"]=53270,["stockText"]="You master the art of Beast training, teaching you the ability to tame Exotic pets and increasing your total amount of Pet Skill Points by 4."}},["changed"]=true,["serverImplemented"]=false,["referenceHash"]="6c32d7b4a8887b4d0d00bd4cc8db9a9129ad105182ea1d94ae8932fe6a2fa82b",["rankCountChanged"]=false},[20002145]={["sourceID"]=1078,["name"]="Explosive Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionTalents\\abilityhunterexplosiveshot",["ranks"]={{["text"]="You fire an explosive charge into the enemy target, dealing ${(72+($SPFI*0.0335)+($RAP*0.067))*2.57} Fire damage to the target. Nearby enemies are also hit, but for 60% less damage. The charge will blast the target every second for an additional 2 sec.",["display"]="You fire an explosive charge into the enemy target, dealing |cffffff00${(72+($SPFI*0.0335)+($RAP*0.067))*2.57}|r Fire|cffffff00 damage to the target. Nearby enemies are also hit, but for 60% less|r damage. T